 style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Ghu-ghabhasughar: &quot;Eating the Foe&quot;, a heretical ritualised cannibalism practiced by some Blood Talons</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Gifala: The spirit wilds</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*gihia: Messenger, news-bringer; journalist, reporter</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Gila Esi: Elm, The Downfallen</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">gishar: A Wound</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*githagarum: Town, hamlet, village; something too small to be a city but still a human settlement</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*githaldum: Hunter cell, as detailed in </span></span></span><i>Hunter: the Vigil</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Gurfuros-Ur: Twin to Garm-Ur and Patron to the Lodge of the Cerberus; there are some who claim he may actually be the son of Dire Wolf</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">gurihal: The physical world</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*gurim: Sick, ill, rabid; insane, crazed, mad; amongst the Pure, it has more positive connotations like &quot;enlightened&quot;, &quot;oracular&quot;, &quot;prophetic&quot; and &quot;martyr&quot;</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*Gurimath: Spirits of the Wyrm, better known as &quot;Banes&quot;, from W:tA</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Gurim-Ur: Rabid Wolf</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*Gurimirska-Maguralath: The Wyrm from W:tA</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*Gurimzir: Formori, spirit-bound spirits of the Wyrm from W:tA</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*gushasu: Greed, want, desire</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Gushasu-Nihur: Bale Hound of Mammon, Maeljin of Greed</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Guzen Ehara: Bank, Usury Lords</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Guzenthima: Money, Golden Thoughts</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>- H -</u></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">*habalthu: Challenge</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Hafal: War, Warmongers</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Halaku: Crow Host</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span styl