:"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T08:01:40-08:00","id":362443,"title":"","content":"Nice work with the Zodiac, Sikla! But,by thw way, i wanted to tell you that you should separate Scorpio from Libra; in your post they are together. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=360246#post360246\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>Libra:</b><br /> <br /> - The Scales (English and Babylonian Name):<i> Uthanga-Ladul</i> (lit. &quot;Helios's Balancer&quot; [the scales were sacred to the Sumerian sun god Shamash])<br /> - The Claws of the Scorpion (Purely Babylonian Name): <i>Suhu-Lalazagsag-Umfin</i> (lit. &quot;Scorpion's [Pain-Tails'] Claws&quot;)</div> </div> </div> </div>Also, i wanted to ask about more translations: The Betrayer / Oath Devourer / Heart of Darkness (in the two meanings 1- litearlly, &quot;the place of deepest shadows&quot; and figuratively &quot;the place/time of deepest despair&quot;) .Thank you in advance, Sikla!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https:/