].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">illu'ru: water lily (lit. &quot;seat on the water&quot;) \u2014 also illu'rellu or illu'ru-ellu<br /> &quot;My Dead Heart&quot;: kunamsursakh (for the really close/intimately involved) or ku-namsu-hursakh (for those who are close, but not yet at third base)<br /> &quot;My Bitch&quot;: kurnidu (lit. &quot;my wolf-woman&quot;, &quot;my she-wolf&quot;) or kurnidiurhir (&quot;my she-dog&quot;, &quot;my dog girl&quot;); for less intimate relations, split these up into kur-ur-nidu or kur-nidu-iurhir<br /> &quot;Honey Trap&quot;: guthespar (lit. &quot;sweet trap&quot;) or hirimasu-guzespar (lit. &quot;a trap of bee's honey&quot;)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Litheon:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">will-o'-the-wisp: zuk-fur (lit. &quot;confusing light&quot;)<br /> Black Dog: Sumukh-Iurhir<br /> Barghest: Namsu-Githagarum-Iurhir (lit. &quot;dead town dog&quot;, as the term &quot;Barghest&quot; may be derived from a term for &quot;town ghost&quot; or &quot;spirit of the funeral bier&quot;)<br /> Shi (Foo Dog): Nirag-Duksim'fa (lit. &quot;the lord's shielding/guardian lions&quot;, as foo dogs are actually Chinese representations of the lion)</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Wild-Eyes:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Mother of My Children:<br /> dur amahan/dur ama<br /> dur-amahan/dur-ama<br /> duramahan/durama<br /> <br /> Father of My Children:<br /> dur farah/dur fafa<br /> dur-farah/dur-fafa<br /> durfarah/durfafa<br /> <br /> &quot;One I Hate the Least&quot;:<br /> tu'ur gulukik ul<br /> tu'ur-gulukik-ul<br /> tu'urgulukikul</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Suleri Drals:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Metal Man:<br /> anna lu'u<br /> anna-lu'u<br /> annalu'u<br /> <br /> Man of Steel:<br /> ba'musum lu'u<br /> ba'musum-lu'u<br /> ba'musulu'u<br /> <br /> Machine Man:<br /> zigaguthushu lu'u<br /> zigaguthushu-lu'u<br /> zigag