.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T14:07:27-08:00","id":371444,"title":"","content":"Well I feel like an idiot for jumping the gun there.<br /> <br /> Has for names from Last Rites we have:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Protagonist: Raven's Scribe<br /> Keeper of the Drowned, mentioned above. &quot;Festering Cadavers and buried dead are his preserve.&quot;<br /> Lady Avona, missed this one earlier. Keeper fears her. <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/River_Avon,_Bristol\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/River_Avon,_Bristol</a> She seems to be this Spirit.<br /> Great Teacher Beneath the Waves, also mentioned above.<br /> Jenny Greenteeth (another water related spirit it seems. Apparently the Keeper saved Raven's Scribe from it)<br /> <br /> There is a few other names. But they are mundane:<br /> Cath, Tanya, Walker. They are Pack Members<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If I post any good ideas regarding house rules feel free to use them! Giving me credit is optional! All I want is people to have fun!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4737-afro-luigi","name":"Afro Luigi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T14:20:11-08:00","id":371450,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Afro Luigi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=371444#post371444\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lady Avona, missed this one earlier. Keeper fears her. <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/River_Avon,_Bristol\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/River_Avon,_Bristol</a> She seems to be this Spirit.<br /> Jenny Greenteeth (another water related spirit it seems. Apparently the Keeper saved Raven's Scribe from it)</div> </div> </div> </div>Lady Avona and Jenny Greenteeth are both aspects of the spirit of the Avon River.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-15T22:28:47-08:00","id":371898,"title":"","content":"Book-keeping notes for Litheon:<br /> <br /> - The entry for &quot;namsu&quot; should be merged with &quot;namzu&quot;. &quot;Namsu&quot; is an alternate spelling of &quot;namzu&quot;, but &quot;namzu&quot; is the canon definition for &quot;wisdom&quot;, it looks like.<br /> <br /> - Maslunim is the canon term that &quot;Iduthah&quot; was meant to define. Iduthah should be removed, as should the entry for warmlings and searings. Please change, also, the entry lu (2) to &quot;la'u&quot;, so that it becomes just &quot;la'u&quot;. This is because the devs have said that there are more homonyms in Sumerian than there are in First Tongue.<br /> <br /> - The entry for fate, &quot;nam&quot;, should be spelt as &quot;namm&quot;.<br /> <br /> - Please add &quot;yageken&quot; to the dictionary. The full definition is in the v1 thread from the White Wolf archives, listed as the oldest form of the dictionary in the original post.<br /> <br /> - There are a bunch of misc. words you missed that I can't otherwise recall right now, but I know one is &quot;imkikik&quot;, which means &quot;to chase or pursue&quot;. Can you take a second look to make sure you got everything from the original two?<br /> <br /> <br /> Translations coming forthwith, I'm just busy right now. I want to get some non-requested stuff done, and I also need to harvest some canon terms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 01-16-2015, 01:40 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T01:07:01-08:00","id":372091,"title":"","content":"Hmm.. there is no entry for Nam, Namm or even fate, for that matter, in my compilation.<br /> <br /> Also, I'll look back into the other forums, but I THINK I got them all. hm.<br /> <br /> Thanks.<br /> <br /> Edit: Found out why. Cause some of the posts, you've added some of the first words to your compolation, but not all of them. When I made mine, I trolled the forums, checked the first word of each post against the list I already had, then moved on if it was already in it. I'll have to check every single post, whether or not it starts a word in the compilation or not. Argh. (Oh, and I made the mistake of thinking V2 had everything that the V1 forum had. ;D )","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All Things Strive.","edited":{"userid":4708,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","user":"Litheon","date":". 01-16-2015, 04:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","name":"Litheon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T06:05:51-08:00","id":372229,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Litheon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=372091#post372091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm.. there is no entry for Nam, Namm or even fate, for that matter, in my compilation.<br /> <br /> Also, I'll look back into the other forums, but I THINK I got them all. hm.<br /> <br /> Thanks.<br /> <br /> Edit: Found out why. Cause some of the posts, you've added some of the first words to your compolation, but not all of them. When I made mine, I trolled the forums, checked the first word of each post against the list I already had, then moved on if it was already in it. I'll have to check every single post, whether or not it starts a word in the compilation or not. Argh. (Oh, and I made the mistake of thinking V2 had everything that the V1 forum had. ;D )</div> </div> </div> </div>Around the time v2 came out, I think I was busy with something IRL and it was draining most of my brainpower, hence why a lot never got transferred over. :-/","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0