ny Thanks! I've been refering to you as a linguistic genius amongst my gaming group! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If I post any good ideas regarding house rules feel free to use them! Giving me credit is optional! All I want is people to have fun!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4737-afro-luigi","name":"Afro Luigi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T13:20:03-08:00","id":372827,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Afro Luigi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=372805#post372805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Many many Thanks! I've been refering to you as a linguistic genius amongst my gaming group! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Well, I wouldn't call myself that.... xD But thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-16T15:18:20-08:00","id":372939,"title":"","content":"Poetic translations are the best translations. Thanks a lot! I promise my next request will involve more.....conventional werewolf activity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3347-wild-eyes","name":"Wild-Eyes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-20T05:27:30-08:00","id":376083,"title":"","content":"I had another request, the phrase &quot;Art through adversity&quot;. I think it fits<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/364394-hunt-idea-need-antagonist?p=367472#post367472\"> this wonderful spirit that Acrozatarim gave to me</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T07:17:25-08:00","id":380962,"title":"","content":"I have a couple deed name requests. Dread Wolf, for an irraka particularly feared and dreaded by pretty much everyone. He who is empty of fear, for a rahu that can't quite be said to be brave. And The Shepherd for an elodoth particularly well known for both guiding and protecting human communities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3347-wild-eyes","name":"Wild-Eyes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T21:23:16-08:00","id":390984,"title":"","content":"Updated to post #191. I HOPEFULLY got all your backlog from all those previous forums, Sikla. But I kinda I just copied the entire threads and then deleted duplicates, so I didn't do any checking.<br /> <br /> This is a total of 885 non canon words, 286 canon ones, and about 180 proper nouns, expletives, wolf names and quotes, for a total of 1351. If I missed any, well... crud, I'm not gonna go back to look for them again, sorry. ;P<br /> Thanks again for doing all the translations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All Things Strive.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","name":"Litheon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T21:43:38-08:00","id":390999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Litheon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=390984#post390984\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Updated to post #191. I HOPEFULLY got all your backlog from all those previous forums, Sikla. But I kinda I just copied the entire threads and then deleted duplicates, so I didn't do any checking.<br /> <br /> This is a total of 885 non canon words, 286 canon ones, and about 180 proper nouns, expletives, wolf names and quotes, for a total of 1351. If I missed any, well... crud, I'm not gonna go back to look for them again, sorry. ;P<br /> Thanks again for doing all the translations.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is absolutely fantastic. Thank you very much for all your help and hard work so far. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Reading back, I realize I kind of sounded dismissive at some parts. It's honestly a bad on my part for sounding so blase before about all the work you've done. That was just bad form on my part, and I'm really sorry if you felt any pressure from me. I wasn't thinking it through at the time. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> *leaves a cookie*<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T22:42:22-08:00","id":391059,"title":"","content":"Nah, the only reason I dissapeared for half month was because work picked up. Don't worry bout scaring me off. xD<br /> <br /> Had nothing to do with the fact that I needed to re-edit and combine a ton of forum posts and remove duplicates, no. ;P<br /> (Or the fact that I was also editing a Tau dictionary/designing a race of tieflings that made sense in a WoD style universe at the same time. So many irons, so many fires.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All Things Strive.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","name":"Litheon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T16:16:35-08:00","id":392012,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Litheon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=391059#post391059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Had nothing to do with the fact that I needed to re-edit and combine a ton of forum posts and remove duplicates, no. ;P<br /> (Or the fact that I was also editing a Tau dictionary/designing a race of tieflings that made sense in a WoD style universe at the same time. So many irons, so many fires.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Still felt the need to apologize, still stand by the fact I should apologize. xD<br /> <br /> Also, that dict sounds amazing. And yay for D&amp;D in WoD!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T16:01:21-08:00","id":396875,"title":"","content":"I am nothing if not a sucker for organizing other people's works. ;P<br /> <br /> If you don't have a backlog, how about a calligraphy set?<br /> Like: calligraphy, ink, inkstone, tattoo, brush, that sort of thing.<br /> <br /> Thinking of doing some shodo based rites. The quote &quot;As I mark the paper with my brush, I will mark the shadow with my will.&quot;, maybe?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All Things Strive.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","name":"Litheon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-07T18:48:16-08:00","id":397058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Litheon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=396875#post396875\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am nothing if not a sucker for organizing other people's works. ;P<br /> <br /> If you don't have a backlog, how about a calligraphy set?<br /> Like: calligraphy, ink, inkstone, tattoo, brush, that sort of thing.<br /> <br /> Thinking of doing some shodo based rites. The quote &quot;As I mark the paper with my brush, I will mark the shadow with my will.&quot;, maybe?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I can do some calligraphy translations. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm a bit busy ATM, but when I get a free minute, I'll go back and translate these along with a few other requests I've been sent. Sadly, this gig isn't my day job. D:","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T07:22:30-08:00","id":412717,"title":"","content":"Translated Words:<br /> <br /> halan: The relatives of other, non-werewolf shapeshifters, who (depending on species) may carry the genetic potential to pass on their relatives' changing abilities. May also be known as &quot;halagarum&quot;.<br /> <br /> gihurah: a ward, a charge; a person or persons under protection<br /> <br /> zifiurhir: African Wild Dogs, also known as African Painted Dogs<br /> <br /> uthanna/uthfil: Gold in the sacred sense (such a sacred artifact of gold) and gold in the destructive sense (such as a golden bullet that could affect gold-sensitive shifters, like the Corax of oWoD).<br /> <br /> amaduthanna: &quot;Mother Moon's silver&quot;, or the moonsilver of oWoD, which does twice the damage normal sil'ver does and is only obtainable by going on a special quest for the Moon. May also be known as &quot;amaduthfil&quot; if the moonsilver obtained is used for harmful or destructive purposes.<br /> <br /> gumuthanna: &quot;Burning gold&quot;, or the sungold of oWoD, which does twice the damage gold does to shifters sensitive to it. Obtainable only by doing certain quests for the Sun, and may also be known as &quot;gumuthfil&quot; if used to do harm or cause negativity.<br /> <br /> shulor: octopus, squid, cephalopod<br /> <br /> kuluhunirih: something that causes great fear, a.k.a. &quot;shiver-making fear&quot;; dread, foreboding<br /> <br /> yeh\u2019ren: wrong, twisted, a mockery or unsettling false image; the Uncanny Valley effect<br /> <br /> kun: whale, cetacean<br /> <br /> ket: shellfish; many also apply to any ocean-bearing creatures with a shell<br /> <br /> kirul: sea monster; spirits (which, by themselves, are also known as <i>kirulath</i>) or mythical/monstrous beings of the deep ocean, some of which resemble Cthulhu or other Lovecraftian beings<br /> <br /> su\u2019ba: a shepherd, a herdsman<br /> <br /> Asadah: An incredibly blasphemous, horrific term to Anshega and Urdaga alike, it refers to the disgusting and terrible acts the Bale Hounds perform in service to the Maeljin. It is not a term used by either Pure, Forsaken or Ghost Wolves/half wolves, but by the Bale Hounds themselves.<br /> <br /> mumarum-keli: \u201cRumble-throat\u201d, the FT name for a capercaillie<br /> <br /> mumarum: To rumble<br /> <br /> For Wild-Eyes:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Dread Wolf:<br /> Urniriha\u2019akdu (\u201cwolf that commands fear itself\u201d)<br /> <br /> He Who Is Empty of Fear:<br /> Nirih Siduk<br /> Nirih-Siduk<br /> Nirisiduk<br /> <br /> The Shepherd:<br /> Lu\u2019u Su\u2019ba<br /> Lu\u2019u-Su\u2019ba<br /> Lu\u2019usu\u2019ba<br /> <br /> OR<br /> <br /> Eren Su\u2019ba<br /> Eren-Su\u2019ba<br /> Erensu\u2019ba</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Litheon, I'll be getting to your writing-related ones soon, I'm currently poking through a list of canon deliciousness (among other things).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 02-24-2015, 09:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T11:12:57-08:00","id":412951,"title":"","content":"Please translate for me the following Deep philosophical statement. Don't start none; WON&quot;T BE NONE!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T18:35:00-08:00","id":413575,"title":"","content":"in'im: a word, a saying, a phrase (compare &quot;namthuf&quot;, which refers more to the written word, rather than the spoken)<br /> namthumuth: ink (lit. &quot;the blood of writing&quot;)<br /> namthumuth'na: inkstone<br /> umfisah: scholar, scribe<br /> namfisamthuf: calligraphy, font work (lit. &quot;the scribal/scholarly arts&quot;)<br /> namthumuzif: a tattoo (lit. &quot;ink-flesh marking&quot;)<br /> namthumusu: a full-body tattoo (lit. &quot;ink-bodied&quot;)<br /> sar: in addition to meaning &quot;each&quot;, it also can mean &quot;to write&quot;<br /> safarah: brush, writing tool (lit. &quot;writing's father&quot;)<br /> sarama: page, writing surface (lit. &quot;writing's mother&quot;)<br /> dabh: a flat surface; to flatten<br /> dar: to crush, to split, to grind; to kill slowly<br /> saranis: paper (lit. &quot;writing leaf&quot;)<br /> <br /> Litheon: <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">&quot;As I mark the paper with my brush, I will mark the shadow with my will.&quot;: Asku kusafarah zifdu sarama, asku kunamm zifdu Hisil.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Perverseness:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">&quot;Don't start none, DON'T BE NONE!&quot;: Nuku nuduaf, NUKU NUKAL! (lit. &quot;You don't start anything, you won't be anything.&quot;)</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-20T23:28:12-08:00","id":413848,"title":"","content":"she'er: vibrancy, radiance<br /> ufufaske: suddenness, unexpectedness; to appear or happen as if in a flash of lightning<br /> kaneha: tranquility, extreme peacefulness<br /> harumfisah: a cartographer (lit. &quot;world scribe&quot;)<br /> badu: to found, to start up","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T00:36:36-08:00","id":413877,"title":"","content":"Much obliged! You do good work, Sikla.<br /> <br /> Question about Perverseness's. Does that still have the same connotation of &quot;You try to start anything, I swear to god I will finish it&quot;? 'Cause the literal translation looks like it means &quot;if you don't make anything of yourself, you'll never achieve anything&quot; which is... entirely different. ;P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All Things Strive.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","name":"Litheon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-21T06:27:59-08:00","id":414000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Litheon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=413877#post413877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Much obliged! You do good work, Sikla.<br /> <br /> Question about Perverseness's. Does that still have the same connotation of &amp;quot;You try to start anything, I swear to god I will finish it&amp;quot;? 'Cause the literal translation looks like it means &amp;quot;if you don't make anything of yourself, you'll never achieve anything&amp;quot; which is... entirely different. ;P</div> </div> </div> </div> I think the implication is meant to be &quot;You don't start [trouble], you won't be [trouble].&quot;, or something like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T10:10:08-08:00","id":416594,"title":"","content":"I have a deed name and a personal philosophy I would like translated.<br /> &quot;Turning North&quot;, with a connotation of 'coming around to a righteous path'.<br /> <br /> &quot;People can change. Nothing stays as it is forever. To be able to choose is the essence of power, and there is always, <i>always</i> a choice.&quot;<br /> <br /> (In other news, in recent posts, you've given me the words I need to talk about my soferet (Torah scribe, female) in First Tongue, and that opens up Lodge of the Hazzan as another route to pull the concept (squishy, currently gameless) down.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently playing at Fabula Rasa in the Cold Equations venue; planning an Obrimos for Fallen London.<br /> I can also be found at <a href=\"http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2192-heu","name":"Heu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T10:16:59-08:00","id":416598,"title":"","content":"I'm glad my translations are helping with your concept, Heu! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Always glad to hear they get the creative juices rolling. I'll add your stuff to the stuff I'm currently working on. :3","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T14:32:23-08:00","id":416891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=414000#post414000\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I think the implication is meant to be &quot;You don't start [trouble], you won't be [trouble].&quot;, or something like that.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You are correct. If you do not make a problem then there will be no problem. Stating and Implying both: I am chill if you are; and in reverse, If you start something, I will end it (and you).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T14:35:08-08:00","id":416892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Perverseness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=416891#post416891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You are correct. If you do not make a problem then there will be no problem. Stating and Implying both: I am chill if you are; and in reverse, If you start something, I will end it (and you).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Please forgive me. I noticed a miss spelling in the post just now. The statement should be: &quot;Don't start none, Won't be none!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T18:41:28-08:00","id":418183,"title":"","content":"The first 11 kennings of 101, including one I translated during the final push for the Viking tier.<br /> <br /> Hafanidu-Sisu: &quot;Battle-Woman's horses&quot; = &quot;Gunnr's horses&quot; = wolves<br /> nirihdu-namusu-kaf: &quot;the frightful (lit. &quot;fear-making&quot;) corpse-sea&quot; = blood<br /> asde kasinfu imin: &quot;rain of spears&quot; = battle<br /> kufat: &quot;sole-thorns&quot; = claws<br /> kurah-namthuf: &quot;rune-caller&quot; (i.e., &quot;calls-to-runes&quot;) = wizard, magic-user<br /> ur-zar-matha: &quot;wolf who runs across the land&quot; = &quot;wolf of the land&quot; = the wind<br /> bhurninzukh: &quot;the jewel of spreading light&quot; = &quot;the light-jewel&quot; = the sun<br /> babhar-namsu: &quot;white death&quot; = death by avalanche<br /> usum-kur: &quot;serpent's slayer&quot; = winter<br /> suthar-bhirtan: &quot;bloodied swan&quot;/&quot;swan of blood&quot; = raven<br /> dumu-zarminalthadu: &quot;wind racers&quot;/&quot;those who are always racing the wind&quot; = horses<br /> kuntha = &quot;whale's way&quot; = the sea<br /> <br /> And a couple of new solo words to add to the dictionary:<br /> <br /> Hafanidu: FT name for the Valkyrie Gunnr<br /> kuf: foot, paw<br /> ninzukh: jewel, gemstone, precious stone<br /> zarminaltha: race (lit. &quot;run-duel&quot;)<br /> dasrithu: Glory, glorification, fame; the renown of Glory<br /> sar umfisanna: a holy book or text, like the Bible or Torah<br /> samu: to sell something<br /> namnuthamnam: to be single, mateless; a single person is simply called &quot;nuthamnam&quot;<br /> <br /> And some canon words:<br /> <br /> Ithama'heme: Aisling Tulane, the insane Cahalith from the spirit wilds in Signs of the Moon<br /> Usumma: A synonym for Uzuhama, a foul name the Pure have given Mother Luna, and also meaning &quot;Bitch Mother&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 02-24-2015, 09:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T19:21:24-08:00","id":418211,"title":"","content":"Heu:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Disufala-Nihhimalan-Tha: &quot;Turns the Right-Star's Way&quot;, or &quot;Turning North&quot; i.e. turning towards the North Star (Vikartha); refers both in terms of turning towards the right path and becoming part of the right path<br /> <br /> &quot;People can change. Nothing stays as it is forever. To be able to choose is the essence of power, and there is always, always a choice.&quot; = &quot;Asezi duhu faladugu. Nu-nih min-nudaka ina nusirah. Faladugu kal annunhia-muth; sharah faladugu kal nal.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Perverseness:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">&quot;Duaf nu habalthu, kal nu habalthu.&quot; = &quot;Start no challenge, and there will be no challenge.&quot;<br /> <br /> OR<br /> <br /> &quot;Duaf nu-nih, kal nu-nih.&quot; = &quot;Start nothing, and there'll be nothing.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> nusirah: Forever, eternity<br /> faladugu: Choice, free weill (lit. &quot;change-ability&quot;)<br /> asezi: A catch-all term for living or currently-existing beings","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 02-24-2015, 10:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T21:33:05-08:00","id":418389,"title":"","content":"This one is pretty long but bear with me:<ul><li><i>\u201cBoth in fighting and in everyday life you should be determined though calm. This isn\u2019t the stagnant calm of a puddle of water, as you know it. But the calmness of the waves crashing against the shore. Meet every situation without tenseness yet not recklessly, your spirit settled yet unbiased. Even when your spirit is calm do not let your body relax, and when your body is relaxed do not let your spirit slacken. Do not let your spirit be influenced by your body, or your body be influenced by your spirit. This, is balance.\u201d</i></li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T21:37:53-08:00","id":418396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=418389#post418389\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This one is pretty long but bear with me:<ul><li><i>\u201cBoth in fighting and in everyday life you should be determined though calm. This isn\u2019t the stagnant calm of a puddle of water, as you know it. But the calmness of the waves crashing against the shore. Meet every situation without tenseness yet not recklessly, your spirit settled yet unbiased. Even when your spirit is calm do not let your body relax, and when your body is relaxed do not let your spirit slacken. Do not let your spirit be influenced by your body, or your body be influenced by your spirit. This, is balance.\u201d</i></li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Ooooh, me likey a challenge. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Any particular story behind this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T22:16:58-08:00","id":418423,"title":"","content":"1. OMG, you gave me a FT term for the Torah? Seriously, you're wholly 25% of why I'm now playing a WB Torah scribe online in a place.<br /> 2. Thank you for your translations of my things! That's a great way to approach 'North'.<br /> 3. Ephsy's just jealous because I can quote great things in Hebrew without needing help. His Rahu said that to aforementioned WB earlier tonight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently playing at Fabula Rasa in the Cold Equations venue; planning an Obrimos for Fallen London.<br /> I can also be found at <a href=\"http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2192-heu","name":"Heu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T22:24:22-08:00","id":418425,"title":"","content":"1. You reminded me I needed a term for that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> If you want to be more specific, though, It's Hursakh-Su'us-Sar Umfisanna, &quot;The Holy Book Received At the Mountain&quot;.<br /> <br /> 2. No problem! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> One of the cornerstones of First Tongue is that it's a &quot;weird, poetic language&quot;. Almost everything has layer and nuance of some kind.<br /> <br /> 3. The fact you can speak Hebrew is so awesome. Hebrew is a beautiful language. I love the fact it sounds like singing when spoken, especially in liturgy. It's like it oscillates up and down the walls.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 02-25-2015, 05:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T01:21:52-08:00","id":418506,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=418425#post418425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit: GAAAH. Six-pointed, NOT Eight-pointed! Get it together, brain!</div> </div> </div> </div>For Chaos!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T06:43:19-08:00","id":418654,"title":"","content":"The next ten kennings, making 21 out of 101 translated:<br /> <br /> nisik-gislak: \u201cgreen clearing\u201d = a shaman\u2019s gathering place<br /> affa-igim: \u201cancestor\u2019s watch\u201d = a stone circle<br /> ulke-hikaon-lulafuna: \u201csky\u2019s black cloak\u201d = nightfall<br /> hugunbath-nihunua: \u201cthe uncut thread\u201d = life, or a destiny to be fulfilled<br /> ersu-nurada: \u201cbed shame\u201d = dying of sickness or old age<br /> uhamusen-kufulum: \u201craven\u2019s food\u201d = corpses<br /> gu\u2019urfil: \u201cbane of wood\u201d = fire<br /> uththu-saridufala: \u201ccounter of every lunar cycle\u201d = \u201ccounter of years\u201d = the moon<br /> umamu-kaf: \u201csea of beasts\u201d = the earth<br /> thima-anah: \u201cthought\u2019s drink\u201d = poetry<br /> <br /> And some Vampire stuff:<br /> <br /> Gakal-Sharguzen: Ventrue (&quot;the cunning and rich&quot;)<br /> Desasu-Ene: Daeva (&quot;those who lust for pleasure&quot;)<br /> Thik-Suthanahag: Gangrel (&quot;chaotic, bloodied savages&quot;)<br /> Ziluzuk-Sumukh: Mekhet (&quot;life-stealing shadows&quot;)<br /> Haf-Ikhi: Nosferatu (&quot;terrible faces&quot;)<br /> <br /> Ordo Dracul: Mirskadur-Umfisah (&quot;scribes of the Dragon's child&quot;)<br /> Lancea Sanctum: Isib-Fisgah (&quot;priests of the dripping mouths&quot;)<br /> Invictus: Mekhar-Igimir (&quot;the silent witness-lords&quot;)<br /> Carthians: Shaghu-Uthaskska (&quot;the rising wail of rage&quot;)<br /> Circle of the Crone: Muthamahan-Umma (&quot;witches of the bloody mother&quot;)<br /> <br /> Strix: virusumukh-ninna (&quot;birds of corrupted darkness&quot;)<br /> Revenants: muth-aziha (&quot;blood-cursed&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 02-25-2015, 11:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T08:01:12-08:00","id":418737,"title":"","content":"No Circle of the Crone? Aww.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.th