rn might have made you miss it.<br /> <br /> *makes deep-fried oreos*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently playing at Fabula Rasa in the Cold Equations venue; planning an Obrimos for Fallen London.<br /> I can also be found at <a href=\"http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2192-heu","name":"Heu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T06:55:51-07:00","id":462202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=462199#post462199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Deal. Also, dunno if you saw, I edited a footnote about asexuality into my first post in this thread of the day. Sorry, page-turn might have made you miss it.<br /> <br /> *makes deep-fried oreos*</div> </div> </div> </div>Noted. Would a translation meaning &quot;lacking attraction&quot; be a better fit? I'm really trying to make sure everything is represented right, people don't seem to understand that it's totally normal for languages to have other pronouns or pronoun-type words/affixes that are missing in English. These are my proposed replacements:<br /> <br /> <b>neteg:</b> asexual (lit. &quot;not attracted sexually&quot;, &quot;doesn't have feelings of attraction&quot;)<br /> <b>netehnar:</b> aromantic (lit. &quot;not attracted romantically&quot;, &quot;doesn't have romantic feelings&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 03-30-2015, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T07:39:34-07:00","id":462238,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=462202#post462202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Noted. Would a translation meaning &quot;lacking attraction&quot; be a better fit? I'm really trying to make sure everything is represented right, people don't seem to understand that it's totally normal for languages to have other pronouns or pronoun-type words/affixes that are missing in English. These are my proposed replacements:<br /> <br /> <b>neteg:</b> asexual (lit. &quot;not attracted sexually&quot;, &quot;doesn't have feelings of attraction&quot;)<br /> <b>netehnar:</b> aromantic (lit. &quot;not attracted romantically&quot;, &quot;doesn't have romantic feelings&quot;)</div> </div> </div> </div>I like that better, personally. Yes. Thank you!<br /> <br /> (I'm ace myself, but [redacted due to likely tmi <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />], so this is a thing for me.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently playing at Fabula Rasa in the Cold Equations venue; planning an Obrimos for Fallen London.<br /> I can also be found at <a href=\"http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2192-heu","name":"Heu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T07:41:10-07:00","id":462240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=462238#post462238\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I like that better, personally. Yes. Thank you!<br /> <br /> (I'm ace myself, but [redacted due to likely tmi <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />], so this is a thing for me.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Not a problem! I aim to try and fit everyone into the circle. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'm glad the new translations work better!<br /> <br /> Edit: More words.<br /> <br /> <b>naafurdur:</b> &quot;lost cub&quot;, or an orphaned wolf-blooded, or a wolf-blooded that turns up after the gene is unnoticed for several generations<br /> <b>ursumugarum:</b> &quot;wolf-children-blooded&quot;, or a child born to two werewolves<br /> <b>lu'urugarum:</b> &quot;human-born-blooded&quot;, or a child born between a werewolf and a human's union<br /> <b>Idhudul:</b> &quot;Moonstruck&quot;, those chosen by Luna to become wolf-blooded<br /> <b>halemm:</b> non-werewolf and non-wolfblooded members of a pack; human members are <b>eren-halemm</b>, canid or animal members may be known as <b>umamu-halemm</b><br /> <b>halemin: </b>a term used for a female, non-werewolf pack member; some do not use this and use <b>urdumin</b> instead (note: this is misspelt as <b>urdurmin</b> earlier on)<br /> <b>halemes: </b>a term used for a male, non-werewolf pack member; some do not use this and use <b>urdumes</b> instead (note: this is misspelt as <b>urdurmin</b> earlier on)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 03-30-2015, 10:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T11:38:41-07:00","id":462518,"title":"","content":"First off, I want to say &quot;Thanks!&quot; again, for translating &quot;Art through adversity&quot;. I would like to add another request though, this one a quote from Tennis pro Arthur Ashe:<br /> <br /> &quot;True heroism is remarkably sober, very undramatic. It is not the urge to surpass all others at whatever cost, but the urge to serve others at whatever cost.&quot;<br /> <br /> Translate it at your convenience, and I'll batter and deep fry some Reese's Peanut Butter Cups to go with those Oreos.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T11:39:32-07:00","id":462519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=462518#post462518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First off, I want to say &quot;Thanks!&quot; again, for translating &quot;Art through adversity&quot;. I would like to add another request though, this one a quote from Tennis pro Arthur Ashe:<br /> <br /> &quot;True heroism is remarkably sober, very undramatic. It is not the urge to surpass all others at whatever cost, but the urge to serve others at whatever cost.&quot;<br /> <br /> Translate it at your convenience, and I'll batter and deep fry some Reese's Peanut Butter Cups to go with those Oreos.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are a smart, smart person. Translation noted! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T20:47:42-07:00","id":463056,"title":"","content":"Working on BigDamnHero's stuff, but here's some things I had kicking around in my brain that I want to get down on paper before I forget them.<br /> <br /> <b>shalas:</b> a triplet; triplets; a trio<br /> <b>Shalas-Maguralath:</b> the Triat of <i>Werewolf: the Apocalypse</i> from oWoD (lit. &quot;The Three Great Totem-Spirits&quot;)<br /> <b>Dur-Abzu:</b> corrupted fountain (lit. &quot;corrupted ritual water-holder&quot;) \u2014 this is a canon term<br /> <b>K'ruhghas:</b> the Burning Iron Spiral, the Abyssal reflection of the Primal Wilds, and home of the <b>Holam'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of Pollution<br /> <b>Thurugaas:</b> the realm of Drugaskan, the Abyssal reflection of Pandemoinum, and home of the <b>Hri'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of Mocking Voices<br /> <b>Anamas:</b> the realm of Arallu, the Abyssal reflection of Stygia, and home of the <b>Gaalubik'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of Decomposition<br /> <b>Bezlaghas:</b> the realm of Ao S\u00ed, the Abyssal reflection of Arcadia, and home of the <b>Thufos'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of Broken Promises<br /> <b>Kafa'as:</b> the Deluge, the Abyssal reflection of the Aether, and home of the <b>Abnata'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of the Eldritch Word<br /> <b>erpetu:</b> a Mage's nimbus<br /> <b>Irifadh:</b> &quot;The High City&quot;, the First Tongue name for Atlantis \u2014 note that this is not the true name of the place, but the closest a name the spirit world has to it, for its True Name was lost along with the place's place in the timeline<br /> <b>Irifadhag-Bhelu'du:</b> &quot;The Highest Lords of the High City&quot; \u2014 known as <b>Bhelu'du</b> for short \u2014 are the &quot;dragons&quot; that were have said to have founded Atlantis<br /> <b>ussagh:</b> First Tongue name for the Arcana, both plural and singular<br /> <b>namusagh:</b> First Tongue name for the Subtle Arcana, both plural and singular<br /> <b>abhrusagh:</b> First Tongue name for the Gross Arcana, both plural and singular<br /> <b>Simdhu:</b> the Fate Arcana<br /> <b>Siadhu:</b> the Time Arcana<br /> <b>Te'emu:</b> the Mind Arcana<br /> <b>Bheredu:</b> the Space Arcane<br /> <b>Ibkameru:</b> the Spirit Arcana<br /> <b>Ummatu:</b> the Life Arcana<br /> <b>Mudanu:</b> the Death Arcana<br /> <b>Dimu:</b> the Prime Arcana<br /> <b>Bah'nu:</b> the Matter Arcana<br /> <b>agyamut:</b> the Abyssal entities known as acamoth","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-01-2015, 01:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T22:25:47-07:00","id":463152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=463056#post463056\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Working on BigDamnHero's stuff, but here's some things I had kicking around in my brain that I want to get down on paper before I forget them.<br /> <br /> <b>shalas:</b> a triplet; triplets; a trio<br /> <b>Shalas-Maguralath:</b> the Triat of <i>Werewolf: the Apocalypse</i> from oWoD (lit. &quot;The Three Great Totem-Spirits&quot;)<br /> <b>Dur-Abzu:</b> corrupted fountain (lit. &quot;corrupted ritual water-holder&quot;) \u2014 this is a canon term<br /> <b>K'ruhghas:</b> the Burning Iron Spiral, the Abyssal reflection of the Primal Wilds, and home of the <b>Holam'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of Pollution<br /> <b>Thurugaas:</b> the realm of Drugaskan, the Abyssal reflection of Pandemoinum, and home of the <b>Hri'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of Mocking Voices<br /> <b>Anamas:</b> the realm of Arallu, the Abyssal reflection of Stygia, and home of the <b>Gaalubik'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of Decomposition<br /> <b>Bezlaghas:</b> the realm of Ao S\u00ed, the Abyssal reflection of Arcadia, and home of the <b>Thufos'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of Broken Promises<br /> <b>Kafa'as:</b> the Deluge, the Abyssal reflection of the Aether, and home of the <b>Abnata'dur-Abzu</b>, or the Font of the Eldritch Word<br /> <b>erpetu:</b> a Mage's nimbus<br /> <b>Irifadh:</b> &quot;The High City&quot;, the First Tongue name for Atlantis \u2014 note that this is not the true name of the place, but the closest a name the spirit world has to it, for its True Name was lost along with the place's place in the timeline<br /> <b>Irifadhag-Bhelu'du:</b> &quot;The Highest Lords of the High City&quot; \u2014 known as <b>Bhelu'du</b> for short \u2014 are the &quot;dragons&quot; that were have said to have founded Atlantis<br /> <b>ussagh:</b> First Tongue name for the Arcana, both plural and singular<br /> <b>namusagh:</b> First Tongue name for the Subtle Arcana, both plural and singular<br /> <b>abhrusagh:</b> First Tongue name for the Gross Arcana, both plural and singular<br /> <b>Simdhu:</b> the Fate Arcana<br /> <b>Siadhu:</b> the Time Arcana<br /> <b>Te'emu:</b> the Mind Arcana<br /> <b>Bheredu:</b> the Space Arcane<br /> <b>Ibkameru:</b> the Spirit Arcana<br /> <b>Ummatu:</b> the Life Arcana<br /> <b>Mudanu:</b> the Death Arcana<br /> <b>Bah'nu:</b> the Matter Arcana<br /> <b>agyamut:</b> the Abyssal entities known as acamoth</div> </div> </div> </div>What are the literal translations of the Arcana-names?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T06:45:28-07:00","id":463423,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seidmadr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=463152#post463152\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What are the literal translations of the Arcana-names?</div> </div> </div> </div>From Fate to Matter: &quot;determined order, destiny&quot;; &quot;distant (as in the time that doesn't have a form or use yet, as things haven't happened) time&quot;; &quot;thought, understanding&quot;; &quot;the space between spaces, the emptiness of potential&quot;; &quot;the stuff of spirits&quot;; &quot;life-force&quot;; &quot;death, the nature of death&quot;; and &quot;creation, the stuff of creation, world-materials&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T19:03:29-07:00","id":464148,"title":"","content":"Sikla, a (hopefully) quick one: 'Deviant'. I suspect 'Deviant Wolf' would be [Deviant]-Ur.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T19:18:24-07:00","id":464171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gebbethine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=464148#post464148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sikla, a (hopefully) quick one: 'Deviant'. I suspect 'Deviant Wolf' would be [Deviant]-Ur.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like this sorta deviant:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sFHtr4IIpI8\" data-code=\"sFHtr4IIpI8\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/sFHtr4IIpI8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T20:34:02-07:00","id":464235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gebbethine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=464148#post464148\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sikla, a (hopefully) quick one: 'Deviant'. I suspect 'Deviant Wolf' would be [Deviant]-Ur.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Na'iska</b>, which also can mean &quot;trickster, jester or fool&quot;, can also apply to the meaning Gebbetine is looking for. If it's a totem he's talking about, it would be <b>Na'iska-Ur</b>, but if it's a mortal being (such as an Urdaga or a canine), it would be <b>Ur-Na'iska</b>, <b>Urna'iska</b> or <b>Ur Na'iska</b>. It depends on how fundamental the behaviour is to the identity of the character, in the latter case.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T23:26:01-07:00","id":464337,"title":"","content":"A few months ago there was a mention on these forums that Uratha might see the Strix as owl-hosts. What would be a good name for them in First Tongue? If you have already translated it, then I apologise for asking unnecessarily. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T02:46:50-07:00","id":464457,"title":"","content":"I asked for something similar; it was literally meant to be a description of the Strix and/or early Vampires. I was prepping for a sort of 'flashback crossover' Chronicle idea I intend to pitch later on.<br /> <b>Sikla Alkis </b>came up with <b>Shurah-Muthim</b> or <b>Shurah-Suthim</b>: Evening Spirit of Blood (latter suggests a war-like spirit, or a spirit of spilt blood) for me.<br /> <br /> As I said, it was a literal description rather than an attempt to name them.<br /> Also because of BigDamnHero's things; here is the general term for Abyssal 'inhabitants' I requested for the same chronicle, followed by the term for the Sorceror-Kings of the Annunaki.<br /> <b>Rihar-Kagagh:</b> Eaters of the World (lit. &quot;Great Jaws that Devour the World&quot; or &quot;Great Appetite that Devours the World&quot;)<br /> <b>Sharnuvisktha-Nir:</b> Kings of Non-Dreams","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T03:20:23-07:00","id":464485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=464457#post464457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I asked for something similar; it was literally meant to be a description of the Strix and/or early Vampires. I was prepping for a sort of 'flashback crossover' Chronicle idea I intend to pitch later on.<br /> <b>Sikla Alkis </b>came up with <b>Shurah-Muthim</b> or <b>Shurah-Suthim</b>: Evening Spirit of Blood (latter suggests a war-like spirit, or a spirit of spilt blood) for me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but I was speaking of them as Owl-hosts, specifically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T06:51:10-07:00","id":464637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seidmadr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=464485#post464485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, but I was speaking of them as Owl-hosts, specifically.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Fa'ninalu</b>. Based on the word for an owl, <b>fa-ninna</b>, wtih the <b>-lu</b> suffix a lot of hosts use.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T09:30:03-07:00","id":464746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=463423#post463423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> From Fate to Matter: &amp;quot;determined order, destiny&amp;quot;; &amp;quot;distant (as in the time that doesn't have a form or use yet, as things haven't happened) time&amp;quot;; &amp;quot;thought, understanding&amp;quot;; &amp;quot;the space between spaces, the emptiness of potential&amp;quot;; &amp;quot;the stuff of spirits&amp;quot;; &amp;quot;life-force&amp;quot;; &amp;quot;death, the nature of death&amp;quot;; and &amp;quot;creation, the stuff of creation, world-materials&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div> Interesting. They don't have a word for the Prime Arcana?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T10:32:44-07:00","id":464843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=464746#post464746\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Interesting. They don't have a word for the Prime Arcana?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's an error on my part. I was reading off a list, as I am not a Mage fan/player and had to go fetch a lot of terms from the White Wolf Wiki. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> The translation is <b>Dimu</b>, which means &quot;bond&quot; or &quot;that which ties together&quot;.<br /> <br /> Edit: More Mage words, just because.<br /> <br /> <b>azmuh:</b> tass, crystallized Mana<br /> <b>azum:</b> Mana<br /> <b>Nusirah-Ti:</b> Adamantine Arrow (lit. &quot;everlasting arrows&quot;)<br /> <b>Nuzuzu Manirikha:</b> The Free Council (lit. &quot;council of the unbound&quot;)<br /> <b>Ennukhu-Nazaru:</b> The Guardians of the Veil (lit. &quot;the watchful guard&quot;)<br /> <b>Kigiriuzul:</b> The Mysterium (lit. &quot;those who seek&quot;)<br /> <b>Simumamzu:</b> The Silver Ladder (lit. &quot;highest of the wise&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-01-2015, 01:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T18:11:31-07:00","id":473567,"title":"","content":"Could you translate this word?<br /> <br /> Hail.<br /> <br /> As in, Hail Hydra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T18:40:03-07:00","id":473589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aiden</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=473567#post473567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could you translate this word?<br /> <br /> Hail.<br /> <br /> As in, Hail Hydra.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>I'ar.</b> Like Lovecraft's &quot;ia ia&quot;, but with a growling noise at the end. For some, it's a burry &quot;l&quot;, some it's a throaty &quot;r&quot;. Whatever the sound, it rattles in the throat like food being shaken to call out an animal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T19:43:17-07:00","id":473685,"title":"","content":"How about this one:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Mother, I ask you for courage. Courage to face and conquer my own fears... Courage to take me where others will not go. I ask you for strength; Strength of body to protect others... And strength of spirit to lead my brothers. I ask you for dedication; Dedication to my duty, to do it well... and Dedication to my territory, to keep it safe. Give me, Mother, concern; For those who would trust me... And compassion for those who need me. And, please, Mother, through it all; be at my side.&quot;</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T20:01:26-07:00","id":473725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=473589#post473589\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>I'ar.</b> Like Lovecraft's &quot;ia ia&quot;, but with a growling noise at the end. For some, it's a burry &quot;l&quot;, some it's a throaty &quot;r&quot;. Whatever the sound, it rattles in the throat like food being shaken to call out an animal.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is perfect beyond words. Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T20:22:19-07:00","id":473774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=473685#post473685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about this one:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Mother, I ask you for courage. Courage to face and conquer my own fears... Courage to take me where others will not go. I ask you for strength; Strength of body to protect others... And strength of spirit to lead my brothers. I ask you for dedication; Dedication to my duty, to do it well... and Dedication to my territory, to keep it safe. Give me, Mother, concern; For those who would trust me... And compassion for those who need me. And, please, Mother, through it all; be at my side.&quot;</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Lemme take a shot at this....<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Amahan, kukal endardu nukukal sanimbathra-thim ku. Sanimbathra udhkukal habalthudu, udhkukal kak-umadu kunirih.... Sanimbathra udhkukal inadu abhanukal inadu. Kukal endardu nukukal annunhia-thim ku \u2014 su-annunhia annakal dum-nazarudu.... Zi-annunhia annakal ses-sahkdu. Kukal endardu nukukal ri-thim ku \u2014 innu-ri annakal guthinnudu.... Kumatha-ri annakal umalas-ladu. Kukal sarra-endardu nukukal, Amahan, annakal ku dam-sumdul.... Zigim-endardu annakal ku-sukhul. Ku i'nahnadu-endardu nuku kalittiku enna zal.&quot;</i><br /> <br /> And derived words:<br /> <br /> <b>innu:</b> duty, obligation, quest<br /> <b>ri:</b> dedication, loyalty, assistance<br /> <b>enna:</b> until, up until, up to now<br /> <b>i'nahna:</b> &quot;I beseech you&quot; or &quot;I ask of you&quot;; it's the polite way of asking a divinity or powerful spirit &quot;please&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-09-2015, 08:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T06:12:01-07:00","id":474185,"title":"","content":"Asking on behalf of a friend:<br /> &quot;Big Stick&quot; - Deed name for a softspoken Rahu (Guthtun-Suthemehir's big brother)<br /> &quot;Watchful-Burr&quot; - The spirit of a burr oak tree; there's a gym and smoothie bar that's been built around the tree, so the implication is that the tree's watching over all who work out there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently playing at Fabula Rasa in the Cold Equations venue; planning an Obrimos for Fallen London.<br /> I can also be found at <a href=\"http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2192-heu","name":"Heu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T08:30:26-07:00","id":474325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=474185#post474185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Asking on behalf of a friend:<br /> &quot;Big Stick&quot; - Deed name for a softspoken Rahu (Guthtun-Suthemehir's big brother)<br /> &quot;Watchful-Burr&quot; - The spirit of a burr oak tree; there's a gym and smoothie bar that's been built around the tree, so the implication is that the tree's watching over all who work out there.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Ka Dukul</b> is what you're looking for. Since he's not inherently made of tree branches or part tree-nymph, you wouldn't put a hyphen in there or affix one word to the other. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> There's already a canon term for oak trees \u2014 <b>hiri hufesi</b> \u2014 and the name means &quot;those who wait&quot;, but your tree is a watchful spirit, not necessarily one of patient. For that reason, I would suggest <b>Shar-Saanigi-Nazarudu</b>, which means literally means &quot;Many-Decorated-Eyes-On Watch&quot; (and which translates down to &quot;Watchful-Burr&quot; for short), and refers to the fringed acorns of the burr oak being like a thousand eyes that watch protectively over the gym and bar.<br /> <br /> And here are the derived terms:<br /> <br /> <b>dukul:</b> a stick, a tree branch<br /> <b>saanu:</b> to be decorated; to be fringed, laced; embellishment, decoration","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-09-2015, 11:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T13:35:46-07:00","id":474854,"title":"","content":"You are a hero, Sikla. If you are ever in Chicago, I would like to buy you a drink.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently playing at Fabula Rasa in the Cold Equations venue; planning an Obrimos for Fallen London.<br /> I can also be found at <a href=\"http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://darkersolstice.tumblr.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2192-heu","name":"Heu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T19:23:23-07:00","id":475219,"title":"","content":"Decided to translate the nicknames/epithets for each of the Tribes.<br /> <br /> <i><u>Blood Talons</u></i><br /> <br /> <b>Fenridu:</b> Destroyers (lit. &quot;those that do as Fenris does&quot;)<br /> <b>Innul:</b> The Service (lit. &quot;the dutiful ones&quot;)<br /> <b>Kursuthul:</b> Rippers (lit. &quot;the ones who rend and slaughter&quot;)<br /> <b>Nihhil-Tagdul:</b> Rat Squad (lit. &quot;vermin-hunters&quot;)<br /> <br /> <i><u>Bone Shadows</u></i><br /> <br /> <b>Urkig:</b> Seekers (lit. &quot;wolves-that-seek&quot;)<br /> <b>Urgur:</b> Spooks (lit. &quot;strange wolves&quot;)<br /> <b>Estha-Thimdu:</b> Binders (lit. &quot;those who craft bindings&quot;)<br /> <br /> <i><u>Hunters In Darkness:</u></i><br /> <br /> <b>Hikhissu:</b> Ghosts (lit. &quot;black shades&quot;)<br /> <b>Uskakul:</b> Slashers (lit. &quot;those who bring death&quot;)<br /> <b>Mekhamahadur:</b> Mother's Children (lit. &quot;the Silent Mother's children&quot;)<br /> <b>Nusala-Nuthul:</b> Chasers (lit. &quot;the tireless&quot;/&quot;the sleepless&quot;)<br /> <br /> <i><u>Iron Masters</u></i><br /> <br /> <b>Kisura-Igim:</b> Wardens (lit. &quot;those who watch the boundary line&quot;), sing. <b>Kisura-Igi</b><br /> <b>Umamu-Nazaru:</b> Zookeepers (lit. &quot;beast guardians&quot;)<br /> <b>Gakal-Kuf:</b> Slinkers (lit. &quot;cunning feet&quot;)<br /> <br /> <i><u>Storm Lords</u></i><br /> <br /> <b>Urfarahag-Unul:</b> Scions of Urfarah (lit. &quot;Urfarah's chosen&quot;)<br /> <b>Skekhsakh:</b> Cold Basatards (lit. &quot;ice-hearts&quot;)<br /> <b>Imin-Skir:</b> Howlers (lit. &quot;storm-voiced&quot;)<br /> <br /> <i><u>Ghost Wolves</u></i><br /> <br /> <b>Urnuza:</b> The Unbound (lit. &quot;free wolf&quot;)<br /> <b>Thakhdu-Dur:</b> Lost Pups (lit. &quot;the children that wander&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-09-2015, 10:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T20:05:19-07:00","id":475251,"title":"","content":"First; hi, how have you been?<br /> second, I have a few requests for you:<br /> <br /> mantis/praying mantis (I guess this could be two words lol)<br /> Khara, who were fera who acted sort of like the Mokole as Gaia's memory.. and happened to be badass Smilodons XD<br /> Scarab Hosts<br /> Clan Gangrel<br /> and heck, just for funsies because I have never really gotten to do a silly/ pop culture request:<br /> Autobot<br /> Decepticon<br /> <br /> sorry for all the words.. it's just been a very long time since I've been able to post, and I've wanted these translations for a loooong time XD<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T20:12:08-07:00","id":475279,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>YeOfLittleFaith</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=459609#post459609\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Requesting translations for spirits called &quot;Runt&quot;, &quot;Grey-Mantle&quot;, &quot;Bone-That-Binds&quot;, and &quot;Father-Fortress&quot; please! The latter is the name of our pack Totem.<br /> <br /> Also &quot;We are the hammer!&quot; if you would be so kind, which is an evocative chant used by our pack during the Siskur-Dah.</div> </div> </div> </div>Soooooo.. you guys are the Imperial Guard? XD<br /> I jest, I jest<br /> <br /> Though that does give me some ideas for other requests ...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T20:13:34-07:00","id":475283,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=475251#post475251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First; hi, how have you been?<br /> second, I have a few requests for you:<br /> <br /> mantis/praying mantis (I guess this could be two words lol)<br /> Khara, who were fera who acted sort of like the Mokole as Gaia's memory.. and happened to be badass Smilodons XD<br /> Scarab Hosts<br /> Clan Gangrel<br /> and heck, just for funsies because I have never really gotten to do a silly/ pop culture request:<br /> Autobot<br /> Decepticon<br /> <br /> sorry for all the words.. it's just been a very long time since I've been able to post, and I've wanted these translations for a loooong time XD<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I did Gangrel a while back \u2014 <b>Thik-Suthanahag</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Khara are easy; the term you're looking for is <b>Garaah-Kuksua</b>, or &quot;the fang-cats of old&quot;. Scarab hosts are <b>Sedhzilu</b>. As for Autobot and Decepticon...hm.<br /> <br /> *quickly goes to look up specifics*<br /> <br /> <b>Ufuful-Rihdam:</b> &quot;Followers of the Gun&quot; for the Decepticons since Megatron apparently turns into a pistol or something...?<br /> <br /> <b>An'nuldam:</b> &quot;Followers of the One With the Divine Stone&quot; for the Autobots, since Optimus Prime leads them with some sort of divine...crystal...thingy called the Matrix? I think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T20:30:57-07:00","id":475306,"title":"","content":"Kind of G1-centric, but both of those work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T20:39:55-07:00","id":475314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=475283#post475283\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I did Gangrel a while back \u2014 <b>Thik-Suthanahag</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Khara are easy; the term you're looking for is <b>Garaah-Kuksua</b>, or &quot;the fang-cats of old&quot;. Scarab hosts are <b>Sedhzilu</b>. As for Autobot and Decepticon...hm.<br /> <br /> *quickly goes to look up specifics*<br /> <br /> <b>Ufuful-Rihdam:</b> &quot;Followers of the Gun&quot; for the Decepticons since Megatron apparently turns into a pistol or something...?<br /> <br /> <b>An'nuldam:</b> &quot;Followers of the One With the Divine Stone&quot; for the Autobots, since Optimus Prime leads them with some sort of divine...crystal...thingy called the Matrix? I think?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, I've been gone awhile, so I did not know, my bad lol<br /> <br /> those names work, though Megs has come a long way from being a pistol lol.<br /> Optimus still has the Matrix of Leadership, so he's pretty much the same lol<br /> <br /> help I'm being possessed by the laughing Louis CK devil oAo;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 04-09-2015, 11:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T21:51:09-07:00","id":475363,"title":"","content":"That's cool. I understand the eagerness, welcome back!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T12:16:40-07:00","id":476192,"title":"","content":"Okay, after reading the Ghost Wolf section of The Rage, I ended up inspired. I was hoping I could get some translations for these.<br /> <br /> \u2022The Tribe of the WATCHERS OF THE LOW, and their Firstborn patron WATCHER WOLF. Their Oath is LET NOT YOUR CHOSEN FALL.<br /> <br /> \u2022The Tribe of LIGHT-BRINGERS, and their Secondborn patron SHINING WOLF(in both the sense of physical illumination, like the light a fire gives off, and spiritual illumination, the clarity a faith or creed gives its followers), the &quot;wayward&quot; son of Rabid Wolf. Their Oath is LET YOUR FAITH BE A LAMP UNTO THE WORLD. <br /> <br /> Sorry for bugging you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T13:21:32-07:00","id":476237,"title":"","content":"How is it bugging me when this thread is meant exactly for this?<br /> <br /> You're in luck \u2014 Watcher Wolf has a translation in Rage, <b>Udzhalla-Ur</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> For Shining Wolf, I came up with <b>Issifath-Ur</b>, who name literally means &quot;The Wolf Who Blazes As If Set Alight&quot;. For the Light-Bringers, I would go with <b>Unbhur-Su'ba</b> (lit. &quot;shepherds of the highest [heavenly] light&quot;), and for the Watchers of the Low, the <b>Duksium-Kuk</b> (lit. &quot;the fangs that shield the weak&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T14:07:04-07:00","id":476267,"title":"","content":"Ah, sorry I missed that. Thanks for this!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:04:32-07:00","id":476431,"title":"","content":"<br /> Awesome as always! Anyway, I have three more for you, Sikla!<br /> <br /> annihilation<br /> <br /> Eviscerating Wolf<br /> <br /> Burning Moon Blood","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:19:09-07:00","id":476459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=476431#post476431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Awesome as always! Anyway, I have three more for you, Sikla!<br /> <br /> annihilation<br /> <br /> Eviscerating Wolf<br /> <br /> Burning Moon Blood</div> </div> </div> </div>The term for destruction or devastation, <b>kusku</b>, can also mean &quot;annihilation&quot;. <b>Uzzukur-Ur</b> is my translation for Eviscerating Wolf (lit. &quot;gut-ripping wolf&quot;), and <b>Izi Iduth Muth, Izi-Iduth-Muth</b> or <b>Iziduthmuth</b> for Burning Moon Blood (depends on how integral the idea of moon-touched blood on fire is to the character's/thing's identity).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:30:27-07:00","id":476464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=476459#post476459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The term for destruction or devastation, <b>kusku</b>, can also mean &quot;annihilation&quot;. <b>Uzzukur-Ur</b> is my translation for Eviscerating Wolf (lit. &quot;gut-ripping wolf&quot;), and <b>Izi Iduth Muth, Izi-Iduth-Muth</b> or <b>Iziduthmuth</b> for Burning Moon Blood (depends on how integral the idea of moon-touched blood on fire is to the character's/thing's identity).</div> </div> </div> </div>thanks again.<br /> <br /> From what I can tell, the latter two are more intended for naming conventions while the first is more utilizing all three words in a sentence, correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:33:12-07:00","id":476465,"title":"","content":"Is Eviscerating Wolf a Firstborn?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:34:47-07:00","id":476466,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=476464#post476464\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> thanks again.<br /> <br /> From what I can tell, the latter two are more intended for naming conventions while the first is more utilizing all three words in a sentence, correct?</div> </div> </div> </div>The two are more commonly found in naming conventions, as names in First Tongue are basically described as a miniature summary of the being or object in question. A storm spirit born from a hurricane, for example, may have their name literally translate out to &quot;Gale Force-Destruction-High Winds&quot; because that's the defining characteristic of their nature. That being said, the first one is also found in naming conventions, and when put into English, is more &quot;something happens to be x&quot; compared to &quot;this is what x inherently is&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:41:37-07:00","id":476471,"title":"","content":"How about a translation of &quot;Lilly of the Valley&quot; as in the flower that was used in Will and Kate's wedding bouquet. Some folklore sources indicate the flower either attracts werewolves or forces them to shapeshift. I figured the flower might have some importance in some werewolf cultures.<br /> <br /> I also want a First Tongue phrase for a funny little thing from Baltic werewolf folklore. The story goes that if one comes across a werewolf that is about to eat some raw meat, and you ask them if they are seriously going to eat the meat raw (keep in mind, werewolves were heroes (if somewhat buffoonish ones) to the Baltic people so talking to random werewolves you meet in the woods wasn't a stupid thing to do in their eyes), the werewolf will smack you in the face with the meat, which will then instantly cook as it hits your face (presumably leaving a nasty burn as punishment for asking a stupid question.). What would the First Tongue phrase for when a werewolves does that to someone that asks the question (I assume it involves a gift in the WoD).<br /> <br /> And finally, I want a first tounge word for the disabled boys with the crutches from Baltic folklore that would lead the Hounds of God to their Christmas parties (a more sinister version of this legend appeared in Spirit Slayers.). I kind of want the meaning of the phrase to play off the Christian idea of the weak leading the strong/ the meek shall inherit the earth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:45:43-07:00","id":476473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=476465#post476465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is Eviscerating Wolf a Firstborn?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, there were only eight ( or nine, or even ten) Firstborn; Dire Wolf, Silver Wolf, Destroyer Wolf, Black Wolf, Red Wolf, Death Wolf, Winter Wolf, and Rabid Wolf ( plus Creator Wolf and Soulless Wolf if you believe the rumors/ possible lies)<br /> <br /> While a part of me thinks there might of been a Second Born called Eviscerating Wolf as one of the Lodge Totems.. by and large it's mainly something of my own creation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 04-10-2015, 09:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T18:02:21-07:00","id":476479,"title":"","content":"Also possibly Ravening Wolf.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=476473#post476473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While a part of me thinks there might of been a Second Born called Eviscerating Wolf as one of the Lodge Totems.. by and large it's mainly something of my own creation</div> </div> </div> </div>I figured that, I was just asking if it was a Firstborn of your own creation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T19:52:47-07:00","id":476513,"title":"","content":"I need a name for Bee Hosts. Anything is fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5632-koorirenchuu","name":"KooriRenchuu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T19:59:13-07:00","id":476518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KooriRenchuu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=476513#post476513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I need a name for Bee Hosts. Anything is fine.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Kudhedilu</b>, lit. &quot;sweet nesters&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T20:22:47-07:00","id":476558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=476479#post476479\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also possibly Ravening Wolf.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I figured that, I was just asking if it was a Firstborn of your own creation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, sort of lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T00:12:37-07:00","id":483286,"title":"","content":"Hi. It's me again.<br /> I've edited my dictionary to be in spreadsheet format for easier use (if I really wanted to full-ass this, I'd make a website, or a database to publish to github, but that's neither here nor there. maybe next iteration.)<br /> It's work in progress, as always (every word is labeled as a noun right now, for one), but you should be able to sort by: english, first tongue, canon-ness, word class and &quot;grouping&quot; which is going to be me grouping like words together (for instance, all wolf blooded tells together).<br /> To sort, click the thing that looks like a martini glass in the right of the icon bar.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1TSgzm7rkkXyobz7wHfIGhGHT34zItHorGJnxsIvsisU/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> I'll still be updating the google doc Compilation with the things that I don't think fit in the dictionary, like Fan Wolf/Pack/Spirit Names, the Phrases, the Kennings, the Zodiac, Vampire and Mage stuff, and the like. As always, hit me up with errors, ideas and general griping you have with it. (I really wish there was a way to do suggestions on spreadsheets, cause then I could crowd source the classing and related terms sections of this with impunity.)<br /> <br /> And now that I'm caught up again after 120 posts of inactivity, back to lurking.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All Things Strive.","edited":{"userid":4708,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","user":"Litheon","date":". 04-17-2015, 03:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","name":"Litheon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T20:41:03-07:00","id":484210,"title":"","content":"Thanks a billion Litheon! You're awesome! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Now, to make your handle an honourary word:<br /> <br /> <b>lidken:</b> record; record-keeper; one who records, memorizes or recites something important; one who takes on a grueling, repetitive job (lit. &quot;one who grinds away at the scraps&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-17-2015, 11:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T21:03:15-07:00","id":484226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BigDamnHero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=462518#post462518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First off, I want to say &quot;Thanks!&quot; again, for translating &quot;Art through adversity&quot;. I would like to add another request though, this one a quote from Tennis pro Arthur Ashe:<br /> <br /> &quot;True heroism is remarkably sober, very undramatic. It is not the urge to surpass all others at whatever cost, but the urge to serve others at whatever cost.&quot;<br /> <br /> Translate it at your convenience, and I'll batter and deep fry some Reese's Peanut Butter Cups to go with those Oreos.</div> </div> </div> </div>Got you that translation!<br /> <br /> <b>&quot;Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm.&quot;</b><br /> <br /> And new derived terms.<br /> <br /> <b>sun:</b> to be humble; to be undramatic, to be downplayed, to be low-key<br /> <b>samm:</b> a price; a cost<br /> <b>danadu:</b> to be glorious, glory; the Renown of Glory","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-18-2015, 12:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T21:06:09-07:00","id":484227,"title":"","content":"Got a cunning and duplicitous Ensih who serves a storm-spirit, favors the form of a calico cat, and infamously impersonated a Helion \u2014 how would you render the titles <b>Squire of Descending Water</b>,<b> Knight of Three Coats</b>, and<b> Prince of False Dawn</b>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T21:18:05-07:00","id":484235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484227#post484227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Got a cunning and duplicitous Ensih who serves a storm-spirit, favors the form of a calico cat, and infamously impersonated a Helion \u2014 how would you render the titles <b>Squire of Descending Water</b>,<b> Knight of Three Coats</b>, and<b> Prince of False Dawn</b>?</div> </div> </div> </div>*thinks*<br /> <br /> <b>a'gal:</b> assistant, servant, squire; to aid or assist, to be on hand to assist<br /> <b>thul:</b> to fall, to descend, to lower<br /> <b>ghudh:</b> a knight; a senior warrior, a high-ranking warrior<br /> <b>nuun:</b> a prince or prince-equivalent; the inheriting son of a ruler<br /> <b>egiir:</b> a princess or princess-equivalent; the inheriting daughter of a ruler<br /> <br /> So Squire of Descending Water is <b>Thul-Illuag A'gal</b>, Knight of Three Coats is <b>Pes-Lulafunag Ghudh</b>, and Prince of False Dawn is <b>Nusethsetuth-Nuun</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T21:48:39-07:00","id":484273,"title":"","content":"So we have a Librarian and an Accountant now? Sweetness and Rye.<br /> <br /> Hey, actually, how about translating <b>&quot;Sweetness and Rye&quot;</b>? It's a general use &quot;Oh that's good&quot;, exclamation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All Things Strive.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","name":"Litheon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T21:52:28-07:00","id":484274,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Litheon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484273#post484273\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So we have a Librarian and an Accountant now? Sweetness and Rye.<br /> <br /> Hey, actually, how about translating <b>&quot;Sweetness and Rye&quot;</b>? It's a general use &quot;Oh that's good&quot;, exclamation.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Guth ni</b>, which means &quot;good prey/food&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T08:02:46-07:00","id":484569,"title":"","content":"And now, it's time for some farming terms, since the upcoming Neolithic Dark Eras entails the rise of agriculture!<br /> <br /> <b>lahafuh:</b> a well; a cistern; a watering hole<br /> <b>ehuth:</b> a barn; a shed or place where animals are kept<br /> <b>al'al:</b> a field used for farming; arable land; fertile land suitable for farming<br /> <b>re'u:</b> to graze; to put animals to pasture<br /> <b>gir'u:</b> an orchard<br /> <b>lugh:</b> a pasture where animals are kept; a field used for the grazing or keeping of animals<br /> <b>far:</b> a ditch; canals or irrigation methods<br /> <b>haba:</b> a plow pulled by animals; to plow the fields to prepare for planting<br /> <b>abin:</b> a seed plow; a plow worked by hand<br /> <b>shus:</b> hay; grain; animal feed<br /> <b>zergu:</b> litter; straw; bedding<br /> <b>kassur:</b> to milk; to extract; to suckle<br /> <b>bhunih:</b> a feeding trough; a bowl used to feed animals with; something used for carrying food or water<br /> <b>ezlah:</b> a bucket<br /> <b>haa:</b> an animal not yet weaned from its mother<br /> <b>kudh:</b> an animal that has been weaned from its mother<br /> <b>habhuum:</b> wool or materials for spinning and clothes-making, like flax<br /> <b>ruduu:</b> spittle; to spit<br /> <b>thibhith:</b> a camel; a llama; an alpaca<br /> <b>maar:</b> a wagon, a cart<br /> <b>kufum:</b> a wheel<br /> <b>zizus:</b> a substance used to kill pests or insects; an insecticide; poisons such as rat poison<br /> <b>zudh:</b> a parcel of land; a piece of land; an acre<br /> <b>gissar:</b> a field used to grow vegetables or other crops<br /> <b>ghuur:</b> to pick; to harvest<br /> <b>ghuurabis:</b> a harvester or harvesting machine (lit. &quot;reaping bull&quot;)<br /> <b>hudaben:</b> a team of animals used to pull something, such as a cart or plow<br /> <b>dhubhul:</b> to grow plants; to grow food or crops<br /> <b>nenal:</b> to raise an animal for food; food-livestock such as beef cows and chicken<br /> <b>mushen:</b> a bird; poultry, chickens, turkeys<br /> <b>gimunhasi:</b> a farm<br /> <b>bhelum:</b> an egg<br /> <b>sagarunu:</b> fertilizer (lit. &quot;soil meals&quot;)<br /> <b>e'ara:</b> a mill; a windmill<br /> <b>erru:</b> a grindstone<br /> <b>zith:</b> flour<br /> <b>tafa:</b> vegetables; a vegetable<br /> <b>hu':</b> legumes; beans, peas<br /> <b>gibh:</b> wheat, grains<br /> <b>sheh:</b> barley; plants that can be made into drinks<br /> <b>hesfil:</b> fruits; a fruit<br /> <b>abhrum:</b> a place of storage; a hayloft; a granary<br /> <b>sagarum-anis:</b> plants that are not grown for food, but sold at market to be turned into products like clothes or other materials","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-18-2015, 07:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T09:25:48-07:00","id":484649,"title":"","content":"And now, geological features!<br /> <br /> <b>guhrur:</b> the base of a mountain, a hill or their ranges<br /> <b>buur:</b> the side or slope of a hill<br /> <b>a'as:</b> a cairn; a monument marker; something that marks the top of a mountain or a special place<br /> <b>gurfadh:</b> the summit, brow, cap or top of a mountain or hill<br /> <b>fa'u:</b> a pass in the mountains<br /> <b>kuk buur:</b> a crag; a very steep, rough part of a mountain (lit. &quot;toothy slope&quot;)<br /> <b>mi'ilu:</b> a watershed; a divide<br /> <b>nimbuur:</b> an escarpment; steep slopes along high areas of land (lit. &quot;high-reaching edges&quot;)<br /> <b>memm:</b> a fold; a gap; a valley<br /> <b>sagar-dagukurum:</b> a landslide, mudslide or landslip (lit. &quot;flood of earth&quot;)<br /> <b>dha:</b> a ledge; a narrow cliff; a sharp, treacherous cliff<br /> <b>daa:</b> a cliff in general<br /> <b>nimdha:</b> a ridge<br /> <b>skekisur:</b> the snow line (lit. &quot;the cold boundary&quot;)<br /> <b>nisikisur:</b> the tree line (lit. &quot;the green boundary&quot;)<br /> <b>illu daa:</b> an underwater shelf<br /> <b>thim'na:</b> scree (lit. &quot;weak stones&quot;)<br /> <b>skur:</b> flat, level<br /> <b>skursakh:</b> plateau (lit. &quot;flat mountain&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-18-2015, 07:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T10:21:42-07:00","id":484717,"title":"","content":"Oceanic features!<br /> <br /> <b>hiri'us-dumu:</b> trade winds (lit. &quot;winds of navigation&quot;, due to their importance in sea travel)<br /> <b>a'ardum:</b> coral<br /> <b>saplu illu:</b> shallow water<br /> <b>saplu:</b> low, shallow, receding<br /> <b>nim:</b> high, rising above<br /> <b>mirkaf:</b> rough waters, bad weather (lit. &quot;raging waters&quot;)<br /> <b>guthkaf:</b> good waters, good weather (lit. &quot;sweet waters&quot;)<br /> <b>ugude:</b> abyssal plain; a wide, flat, open area underwater<br /> <b>makafar:</b> oceanic trench (lit. &quot;sea-canal&quot;)<br /> <b>bhurudhursakh:</b> oceanic mountain or undersea volcano (lit. &quot;deep mountain&quot;)<br /> <b>nimugude:</b> oceanic plateau (lit. &quot;abyssal plain that rises up&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-18-2015, 07:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T16:24:19-07:00","id":484936,"title":"","content":"Okay, I can't believe I'm saying this, but I am running out of ideas for stuff to translate. If anyone has any idea for things to translate, any and all suggestions are needed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T17:00:33-07:00","id":484945,"title":"","content":"In honor of the fact that Beast the Primordial is coming out in 4 weeks and three days(and the fact that they're just started releasing spoilers), maybe an attempt to translate the Family names? Link to the latest spoiler(and more importantly, the one that describes the Families) here: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/beastfamily/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/beastfamily/</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T19:33:35-07:00","id":485023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484945#post484945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In honor of the fact that Beast the Primordial is coming out in 4 weeks and three days(and the fact that they're just started releasing spoilers), maybe an attempt to translate the Family names? Link to the latest spoiler(and more importantly, the one that describes the Families) here: <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/beastfamily/\" target=\"_blank\">http://theonyxpath.com/beastfamily/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Huh. Looks like some of these are Sumerian/fit into Sumerian already.<br /> <br /> <b>Anaghem:</b> the Anakhim Family from <i>Beast: the Primordial</i> (lit. &quot;stones that fell from heaven&quot;)<br /> <b>Ezmaggi:</b> the Eshmaki from <i>Beast: the Primordial</i> (lit. &quot;those that make a place's blood run cold&quot;)<br /> <b>Magaragh:</b> the Makara from <i>Beast: the Primordial</i> (lit. &quot;those who drown [their victims] in harbours and the sea&quot;)<br /> <b>Nemmdaru:</b> the Namtaru from <i>Beast: the Primordial</i> (lit. &quot;those cursed with an ugly fate&quot;)<br /> <b>Uhalahu:</b> the Ugallu from <i>Beast: the Primordial</i> (lit. &quot;exalted/lofty beasts&quot;)<br /> <br /> The beast themselves are known as <b>Ghlumamudur</b> (&quot;Ghlu'oh's beast-spawn&quot;); their families are known as <b>muthala</b> (&quot;bloodline&quot;, &quot;inheritance&quot;). And the Dark Mother is <b>Ghlu'oh</b>, formally known as <b>Ghlu'oh-Umamuhan</b> (&quot;Ghlu'oh, the Mother of Beasts&quot;) or just <b>Umamuhan</b> (&quot;the Beast-Mother&quot;).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-18-2015, 10:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T20:56:30-07:00","id":485044,"title":"","content":"Came up with a few more....<br /> <br /> <b>izirih:</b> acid, acidic (lit. &quot;burn-eats&quot;)<br /> <b>ehla:</b> canopy, awning<br /> <b>hespar nimhagar:</b> appliances (lit. &quot;tools of trapped lightning&quot;)<br /> <b>zummur:</b> a roof<br /> <b>zummafulu:</b> an attic<br /> <b>ekir thakkan:</b> back door, back gate; a back entryway<br /> <b>dhim:</b> a column, a pillar, a baluster<br /> <b>unuhzar:</b> a garden, a yard<br /> <b>bussur:</b> private, secret<br /> <b>bussur-unuhzar:</b> a private garden; a backyard; the back garden<br /> <b>skeh:</b> to cook over a grill or fire; to barbecue<br /> <b>skemut:</b> a barbecue gathering<br /> <b>ighar:</b> a wall, a fence<br /> <b>igharigsu:</b> a baseboard, a mopboard; wall joining<br /> <b>egrun:</b> a basement; a root cellar; a wine cellar<br /> <b>thus:</b> a bathroom; a room for washing or bathing<br /> <b>giush:</b> toilet; privy; a place for dumping waste<br /> <b>giushurum:</b> a chamberpot<br /> <b>am'ru:</b> beam, timber, plank<br /> <b>essah:</b> private room; bedroom; one's private chambers or office<br /> <b>buzhar:</b> curtains, blinds, shutters<br /> <b>sagarag-su'ba:</b> a broom (lit. &quot;dust's shepherd&quot;)<br /> <b>minersu:</b> bunk bed (lit. &quot;bed for two&quot;)<br /> <b>fadh-gus:</b> carpet (lit. &quot;pelt for hard ground&quot;)<br /> <b>fadh:</b> hard ground; bare stone; packed earth<br /> <b>ramamaar:</b> cars, a car (lit. &quot;growling wagons&quot;)<br /> <b>ramamaar garum:</b> carport, garage<br /> <b>ulha:</b> ceiling<br /> <b>ifisardhim:</b> chimney (lit. &quot;smoking pillar&quot;)<br /> <b>lal:</b> small, tiny, miniscule<br /> <b>lalarak:</b> a closet or small space of storage<br /> <b>luk:</b> to clean; to wash; to bathe<br /> <b>luksusk:</b> clothes washer, washing machine (lit. &quot;bathes-clothes&quot;)<br /> <b>luksaragh:</b> clothes dryer, dryer (lit. &quot;dries-clothes&quot;)<br /> <b>zin'na:</b> concrete (lit. &quot;stone of the house/building&quot;)<br /> <b>buzhar dukul:</b> curtain rod (lit. &quot;curtain branch&quot;)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-19-2015, 11:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-18T23:58:12-07:00","id":485190,"title":"","content":"If you're looking for terms to translate and are willing for a decent sized list. I have (more than) a few Ordo Dracul related words I wouldLove to have translated for a Werewolf game featuring several Ordo Dracul NPCs!<br /> <br /> Order Specific:<br /> Ordo Dracul<br /> Order of the Dragon<br /> The Defiant<br /> Kogaion<br /> Mysteries of the Dragon<br /> Coils<br /> Scales<br /> Vlad Tepes the Impaler! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> Dragon's Nest<br /> Wyrm's Nest<br /> Perilous Nest<br /> Chapterhouse<br /> Crucible<br /> Chrysalis<br /> <br /> and a few specific to one of the NPCs that they'll be interacting with:<br /> Transhuman, Transhumanity, Transhumanism<br /> Post-Human<br /> Trans-Vampire<br /> Post-Vampire<br /> Evolution<br /> Forced/Guided Evolution<br /> <br /> Also I have to say those Ocean related words you just released almost made me shout out with glee! =D I love the ocean, and it'll feature prominently in the werewolf chronicle I am brewing up, so those words will come up! =D","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If I post any good ideas regarding house rules feel free to use them! Giving me credit is optional! All I want is people to have fun!","edited":{"userid":4737,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4737-afro-luigi","user":"Afro Luigi","date":".  Edit: forgot a few. 04-19-2015, 03:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4737-afro-luigi","name":"Afro Luigi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T08:12:15-07:00","id":485418,"title":"","content":"Some of these Ordo Dracul terms have been translated if you check the dictionary. I'll put here the ones that haven't. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Mirskadur-Umfisah:</b> Order of the Dragon (same as their other name, Ordo Dracul)<br /> <b>Sahafalul:</b> The Defiant (lit. &quot;the one who disagrees/shakes their head&quot;); plural is <b>Shasahafalul</b>]<br /> <b>An'gusdur-Hursakh:</b> Kogaionon (lit. &quot;the mountain of the heavenly hide-born [Zalmoxis]&quot;)<br /> <b>Mirskaglil:</b> Mysteries of the Dragon<br /> <b>ebhik:</b> A coil/length (of rope, muscle, snakeskin, etc.)<br /> <b>Lilebhik:</b> A Coil of the Ordo Dracul (lit. &quot;piece of secret knowledge&quot;)<br /> <b>Lilsuhum:</b> A Scale of the Ordo Dracul (lit. &quot;a knowledge-bound piece of dragon-hide&quot;/&quot;a knowledge-bound scale&quot;)<br /> <b>Mirskadur:</b> Vlad Tepes (lit. &quot;Child of the Dragon&quot;)<br /> <b>Mirska Edi:</b> Dragon's Nest/Wyrm's Nest<br /> <b>Namus Edi:</b> Perilous Nest (lit. &quot;Nest of Death&quot;)<br /> <b>Lal Garum:</b> Chapterhouse (lit. &quot;lesser house&quot;)<br /> <b>nedhudu:</b> Crucible, melting pot (the other term is translated in the dictionary as <b>athi kuth</b>, a trial or test)<br /> <b>falasuhum:</b> Chrysalis (lit. &quot;shell of change&quot;)<br /> <b>manlu'u:</b> Transhuman, transhumanity, transhumanism (lit. &quot;humans exalted to heavenly heights&quot;)<br /> <b>lu'unnakal:</b> post-human (lit. &quot;human-before&quot;)<br /> <b>nimmuth:</b> Trans-vampire, trans-vampirism (lit. &quot;rises beyond the blood&quot;)<br /> <b>muthrih-nu'ase:</b> post-vampire (lit. &quot;blood-eater no more&quot;/&quot;no longer craves hungrily for blood&quot;)<br /> <b>ka'fala:</b> evolution (lit. &quot;the Great Change&quot;)<br /> <b>gu'usufala:</b> forced/guided evolution (lit. &quot;weighted change&quot;/&quot;pressured change&quot;)<br /> <br /> More ocean-related words will come as soon as I think of them. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Edit: There are some word-doubles in the dictionary that need clarifying. The writers have said that homonyms are rare in FT, so here's the new changes:<br /> <br /> - <b>Fath</b> (hard, packed earth, etc.) becomes <b>fadh</b> (and by extension, <b>fath-gus</b> becomes <b>fadh-gus</b>).<br /> - <b>Nuza</b> (<span style=\"font-family:arial\">unmoving, stagnant; unenergetic, lethargic; slowness, torpor) becomes <b>nuzah</b><br /> - <b>Ri</b> (</span><span style=\"font-family:arial\">dedication, loyalty, assistance) is now <b>ri'i</b><br /> - <b>Si</b> (</span><span style=\"font-family:arial\">to fill, to load, to load up) is now <b>si'i</b><br /> - <b>Za</b> (</span><span style=\"font-family:arial\">to close, to shut out, to block off) is now <b>zah</b></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-19-2015, 11:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T10:14:11-07:00","id":485473,"title":"","content":"Sniping <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-anser-werewolf-2e-edition?p=485449#post485449\">Charlaquin</a> to queue up &quot;bodhisattva.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T10:45:23-07:00","id":485497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=485418#post485418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some of these Ordo Dracul terms have been translated if you check the dictionary. I'll put here the ones that haven't. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Apparently I didn't look hard enough before asking. My mistake!<br /> <br /> Also thanks for the translations! Amazing work!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If I post any good ideas regarding house rules feel free to use them! Giving me credit is optional! All I want is people to have fun!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4737-afro-luigi","name":"Afro Luigi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T13:06:44-07:00","id":485605,"title":"","content":"To be fair, it'd also that I haven't organized it well enough to be easy to search through. ;P<br /> <br /> Also, man, Alkis, I was just about to ask you about the doubles. Stop being efficient.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>All Things Strive.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4708-litheon","name":"Litheon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4708_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"34"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T15:08:33-07:00","id":485770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Litheon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=485605#post485605\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be fair, it'd also that I haven't organized it well enough to be easy to search through. ;P<br /> <br /> Also, man, Alkis, I was just about to ask you about the doubles. Stop being efficient.</div> </div> </div> </div>Never! *hisses*<br /> <br /> @Afro Luigi: Hey man, it's cool! Just refer to the dictionary when in doubt, as it's got almost 2000 words for you to use. There's no shame in asking, though; some of the words already done aren't used as much as others, so going back and checking that they're there is always good.<br /> <br /> Edit: continuing the word list from above....<br /> <br /> <b>muh:</b> bowl, bowls; dish, dishes; pottery, pots<br /> <b>lukmuh:</b> dishwasher (lit. &quot;bathes dishes&quot;)<br /> <b>ghuth:</b> a shelter or hutch where animals are kept, such as a chicken coop or a dog house<br /> <b>thulakkan:</b> a smaller door for animals to come through or things to be pushed through, such as a doggie door or the opening to a dumbwaiter<br /> <b>anazagga:</b> bell, door bell (lit. &quot;chirping metal&quot;)<br /> <b>thakasinfu:</b> door jamb, doorpost<br /> <b>abh:</b> window, peephole<br /> <b>buurag abh:</b> dormer (lit. &quot;slope window&quot;)<br /> <b>ahlalu:</b> a drain, a tube, a pipe<br /> <b>imin ahlalu:</b> downspout, waterspout, rone<br /> <b>ki'i garum:</b> downstairs (lit. &quot;below-house&quot;)<br /> <b>nim garum:</b> upstairs (lit. &quot;up-house&quot;)<br /> <b>dinik:</b> air vents; duct; passageway<br /> <b>sagar-hespar:</b> vacuum cleaner (lit. &quot;dust trap&quot;)<br /> <b>sagar-muh:</b> dustpan (lit &quot;dust cup&quot;)<br /> <b>ghizal:</b> eaves; a screen; a filter or sieve<br /> <b>assum:</b> to power; to give power, to empower<br /> <b>assumikhi:</b> electrical outlet (lit. &quot;faces that power&quot;)<br /> <b>su'um:</b> to circulate; to revolve<br /> <b>assu'um:</b> electrical system, circuitry (lit. &quot;circulating power&quot;)<br /> <b>uhru:</b> family room; den (of a human house); the parts of an animal den where the young are kept<br /> <b>ba'a:</b> a palm leaf or frond; a fan; fan-like or fanning out<br /> <b>illurududu:</b> spout, faucet, tap (lit. &quot;water-spitter&quot;)<br /> <b>giser:</b> fence; boundary; limit<br /> <b>giser-unuhzar:</b> fenced yard; a fenced garden<br /> <b>gi:</b> place; ground; the floor or flooring<br /> <b>ayah:</b> to surround; to frame; a frame or one's surroundings <br /> <br /> And the names of the winds:<br /> <br /> <b>Isktanu:</b> The North Wind<br /> <b>Hanakmeyu:</b> The South Wind<br /> <b>Sadyumu:</b> The East Wind<br /> <b>Ammurru:</b> The West Wind","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 04-19-2015, 07:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T19:54:57-07:00","id":485952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=485473#post485473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sniping <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-anser-werewolf-2e-edition?p=485449#post485449\">Charlaquin</a> to queue up &quot;bodhisattva.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Didn't see this one. That would be <b>Belisibtu</b>, which means &quot;master of all that has been woven&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,