ote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> NO!<br /> We are the unworthy! Your generosity and efforts have been great, to stumble but twice is a great feat. Deserving of applause and acclaim, not ridicule. </div> </div> </div>asdkfkghkj Thank you. *blush*<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-02T08:37:54-07:00","id":576396,"title":"","content":"<b>khidim:</b> a pitchfork or hay fork<br /> <b>gidhem:</b> a spirit that haunts an object, like a haunted chair<br /> <b>hidi:</b> a drain or sewage pipe<br /> <b>gikh:</b> to become sick; to fall ill; to struggle with an illness<br /> <b>gih:</b> a tree or plant used to make incense<br /> <b>khih:</b> tree or plant resins burnt as incense<br /> <b>hihir:</b> a number of poultry, fowl or other birds presented as a gift, offering or dowry<br /> <b>khighir:</b> a chariot<br /> <b>hin:</b> an adze; a hoe<br /> <b>khin:</b> the shekel of the ancient and modern Middle East, both the monetary value and the unit of weight it presented<br /> <b>khi'il:</b> to harness; to take control of; to attach a harness or other such device to<br /> <b>hil:</b> a treasure<br /> <b>khilim:</b> a barrier; a bolt or clasp; to lie across or block something<br /> <b>hilhil:</b> to be entwined or twisted; to be difficult to undo; to be difficult to understand or figure out, such as a Gordian Knot<br /> <b>ghilim:</b> a makeshift rope, such as a rope made out of tied bedsheets; rope made by hand<br /> <br /> More g-homonyms picked away at.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 07-02-2015, 12:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-02T10:40:06-07:00","id":576561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=576340#post576340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> NO!<br /> We are the unworthy! Your generosity and efforts have been great, to stumble but twice is a great feat. Deserving of applause and acclaim, not ridicule.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Wait, does Sikla have a deed name for this? Cause that needs to happen (and be translated of course <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/c