 Border Marches, which they say was once the truth of the world. A land of flesh and spirit alike, before the actions of both caused a separation, and then a calamity like none in history before it ended Pangaea.<br /> <br /> The Makilu are still here, and they still carry the Memory of that vanished world.<br /> <br /> (Alternately: &quot;Saurilu,&quot; which also fits.)</div> </div> </div> </div>BRILLIANT! Do you have more on these feathery-scaly memory-keepers?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-19T00:45:56-07:00","id":708326,"title":"","content":"Oh, it's totally the Mokol\u00e9 from <b>Apocalypse</b> brought back to <b>Forsaken </b>terms. I'm preparing for a full-scale rebirth of my favorite playable race in any RPG ever to my favorite version of the WoD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-19T06:49:02-07:00","id":7