://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T16:58:16-08:00","id":769638,"title":"","content":"My best guess? It means something along the lines of &quot;the way of the forceful bite&quot; or &quot;the way of the biting dogs&quot;. Then again, it also could mean &quot;a wolfish attack force&quot; or &quot;an advanced attack force (for a pack)&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 11-19-2015, 08:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-19T21:12:24-08:00","id":769752,"title":"","content":"While 'the way of the forceful bite' and 'the way of the biting dogs' sound like really interesting ways of life, from the other two I'm guessing perhaps wolves-as-packmates?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T05:05:14-08:00","id":770662,"title":"","content":"Could you happen to translate the Rank names from <i>Werewolf: the Apocalypse</i>? (Cliath, Fostern, Adren, Athro, Elder)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u><b>My Homebrew</b></u><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1PLu_eTg03h4ogiTSGSkzEB7T_1YpB9_VkhHmgZN41-I/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Star Wars d10</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">T</a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">he Fallen for Demon: the Descent</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-TDr4NF_5cUn-In2vjI9P5LTKqsu9B4-OMxbnbaTgT8/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Requiem for a Masquerade: VtR 2e Cainite Conversion</a> (<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HpKi5giBNsQrZRLIRRjaCe7sHVm1Q13ravVYlE45Dbw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Vampira Roma</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1601-dreaminggod","name":"Dreaminggod","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"745"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-21T10:40:48-08:00","id":770825,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=769638#post769638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My best guess? It means something along the lines of &quot;the way of the forceful bite&quot; or &quot;the way of the biting dogs&quot;. Then again, it also could mean &quot;a wolfish attack force&quot; or &quot;an advanced attack force (for a pack)&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Advanced Attack Force makes me think of &quot;Row, row, row your boat, sneaking up the stream, lock and loaded in tactic mode, United States Marines&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T12:22:41-08:00","id":774191,"title":"","content":"Could you translate &quot;Detective&quot;? It's going to be a shadow name, so shorter is better. I was thinking maybe &quot;Truth Hunter&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T13:52:54-08:00","id":774255,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solidork</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=774191#post774191\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could you translate &quot;Detective&quot;? It's going to be a shadow name, so shorter is better. I was thinking maybe &quot;Truth Hunter&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Lul-Tagdul: </b>Literally 'Truth-Hunter'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T09:55:19-08:00","id":776079,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=774255#post774255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>Lul-Tagdul: </b>Literally 'Truth-Hunter'</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks!<br /> <br /> Is there a word for &quot;Mage&quot;? I see translations for the orders and paths, but not for mages in general.(I checked the main book too, didn't see it)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-28T15:52:57-08:00","id":776246,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solidork</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=776079#post776079\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks!<br /> <br /> Is there a word for &amp;quot;Mage&amp;quot;? I see translations for the orders and paths, but not for mages in general.(I checked the main book too, didn't see it)</div> </div> </div> </div>There's one for Warlock, which is how Uratha call Willworkers; Just like they address Kindred as Blood-Thieves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T11:01:00-08:00","id":781210,"title":"","content":"How about a word for someone or something from your life before your first change. There can be a TON of different connotations for how someone feels about said person/thing (from desperate longing to complete disdain) but I don't know if there should be separate words for those cases.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-06T17:27:52-08:00","id":781413,"title":"","content":"Here's a simple one as a First Tongue hint for The Pack for you: <i>estha</i> :\u200b)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T09:55:21-08:00","id":781734,"title":"","content":"Making up some cannibalistic snake spirits for a game. The head of the <i>ilthum</i> &quot;those who consume&quot; is named &quot;Feeding Apotheosis&quot;, no idea how to translate that.<br /> <br /> But the rank 1 and 2 rabble I'm literally calling &quot;Self-Eating Snakes&quot;. Would that be Rihku-Mirska?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T12:34:44-08:00","id":781793,"title":"","content":"Well, Apotheosis is the act of becoming a god, so I'd probably use the Rank 6 version of Dihir as a root for it, but my translations are usually pretty clumsy. This thread is one heck of a boon for those who want to give spirits proper names and some dialogue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T18:56:46-08:00","id":782007,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=781793#post781793\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, Apotheosis is the act of becoming a god, so I'd probably use the Rank 6 version of Dihir as a root for it, but my translations are usually pretty clumsy. This thread is one heck of a boon for those who want to give spirits proper names and some dialogue.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that spirit died in a flurry of claws and fangs from the party today anyway, so it's all academic at this point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-09T21:11:16-08:00","id":783223,"title":"","content":"@Ephsy: Nice work on the translation, Ephsy! I'm glad to see people are becoming familiar enough with it that they're taking a crack at translating things themselves. Warms my heart like a fire on a cold night. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> @Acrozatarim: Ooh, &quot;The Bound&quot;! I like it! Solidork, go with that.<br /> @Solidork: The word you're looking for is &quot;umma&quot;. It was in the First Edition, but they didn't put it in the Second Edition glossary for some reason.<br /> @BigDamnHero: Yes, you are correct. Rihku-Mirska would be &quot;self-eating snakes&quot;. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'll see what I can whip up for Feeding Apotheosis.<br /> <br /> @Dreaminggod:<br /> Ur-Aldacahha: Legend (lit. &quot;wolf of legend&quot;)<br /> Affaliful: Elder (may still be applied to elder werewolves who are fairly young, but in the case of young elders, they may be known as &quot;Affalifir-Zul&quot;, or &quot;old souls&quot;, for their deeds)<br /> Ne'ul: Athro (lit. &quot;respected one&quot;)<br /> Harzul: Adren (lit. &quot;knowledgable/experienced one&quot;)<br /> Annul: Fostern (lit. &quot;one who has earned approval&quot;)<br /> Sudekhul: Cliath (lit. &quot;one who has been accepted [in]&quot;)<br /> <br /> Derivatives:<br /> annu: to approve; approval<br /> <br /> More to come. I have stuff on my to-do list still to pick at, and I apologize I don't have a larger batch of translations ready right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T03:53:33-08:00","id":783349,"title":"","content":"Ah, <i>estha </i>wasn't a suggestion for what Solidork was looking for, just me throwing out a random teaser <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It also doesn't mean \u200b'The Bound', although that is quite an apt translation, albeit on a metaphorical level.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T07:26:50-08:00","id":783430,"title":"","content":"<div align=\"center\">I'll try my hand, since it shouldnt be too hard since I can just modify an existing word with the rules given by An Fhuiseog earlier in the thread. I've only seen nuzusul refer to werewolves right before their first change because that is the only time you know, but I don't see any reason why you werent a nuzusul your whole life up until that point if you are talking in retrospect.</div> <br /> &quot;From my nuzusul-ness&quot; - namnuzusulguta?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T10:57:51-08:00","id":783525,"title":"","content":"It's the same reason pre-pubescent kids aren't called adolescents.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-18T10:22:10-08:00","id":788847,"title":"","content":"What would be an appropriate translation of &quot;The Rite of Consecrated Ground?&quot; For context, it's a symbolic gathering in the Protectorate when a young pack has earned the right to claim territory for themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/606-aynie","name":"Aynie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar606_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-19T12:59:17-08:00","id":789388,"title":"","content":"I have an idea for something. How about the Non-Canon term Riding the Winds of Decay. Riding the Winds of Decay was an idea that was going to be used in Vampire the Masquerade before Apocalypse was created, it was when both werewolf and Vampire would run together on nights of the Full moon killing any prey that got in their way. The idea was that this was due to Luna wanting both of the Children of the Moon to find peace in the Great Hunt but it was scraped upon the Release of Apocalypse because they then added Gaia into the game and the Wyrm.<br /> But I have been able to re-Implement it into my games, when the Moon is Full in the Night Sky Vampires (Gangrel) will have to make rolls to resist running into the outlands and hunting for prey. Rahu werewolves also have to make Death Rage rolls but they try and hunt Down the nearest animal because their inner beast is telling them to. While this is seen as horrible by the vampires of non-gangrel clans and is seen as unnatural by Non-Rahu, the Rahu believe it is a natural feeling and that Luna wants them to Ride the Winds of Decay with the Feral blood suckers. Now I am still working this out but I think it would be a great idea for the List.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10343-the-anubi","name":"The Anubi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-21T03:35:15-08:00","id":790188,"title":"","content":"<i><b>Sidhari</b><br /> \u2022Zelasu<br /> \u2022Saghush</i><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T16:20:42-08:00","id":795164,"title":"","content":"<i>Umarah </i>and <i>Umaraha'e</i>, both coming soon. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-11T13:49:49-08:00","id":806440,"title":"","content":"I searched the thread in hopes the individual components would be translated already but since they're (the not-obvious ones I mean) noooot.<br /> <br /> Could you translate &quot;Perfect/Perfected Wolf&quot; and &quot;Pretender Wolf&quot;? (The context of the second is of &quot;one who pretends to be a Wolf/Werewolf&quot; rather than &quot;a wolf who pretends&quot; incidentally.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":188,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","user":"YeOfLittleFaith","date":". 01-12-2016, 11:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-12T11:14:10-08:00","id":807160,"title":"","content":"Could I get a translation for the name of an Earthbound Idigam? Currently, I have him named The Filth That Taints but to be honest, if anyone can think of a cooler way to render that (It coalesced in the presence of a toxic pollutant dump and wants to explore the concept of pollution) that'd be cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-26T15:45:53-08:00","id":817218,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leetsepeak</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=807160#post807160\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Could I get a translation for the name of an Earthbound Idigam? Currently, I have him named The Filth That Taints but to be honest, if anyone can think of a cooler way to render that (It coalesced in the presence of a toxic pollutant dump and wants to explore the concept of pollution) that'd be cool.</div> </div> </div> </div>Some time ago I proposed a word for the verb &quot;defile,&quot; <i>fel</i>, which might be useful here. Coining another word, I would propose <b>Fel-Lagha</b>, &quot;The Defiling Filth.&quot; Alternately you might go with <b>Kasala</b>, meaning &quot;the great unclean one&quot; or &quot;the great unhealthy one.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T16:03:40-08:00","id":818025,"title":"","content":"Somebody could please translate <b>Moon Presence </b>for me? I need it as a name for a creature, just so you know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-29T20:56:42-08:00","id":819671,"title":"","content":"Hmm... Sikla has previously introduced <b>lila</b>, meaning &quot;a ghostly wind; the presence of spirit,&quot; which would fit if you mean &quot;presence&quot; in terms of an ephemeral or unseen entity in a place. Alternately, <b>zaanyah</b> specifically refers to a fearful or terrifying presence. In any case, <b>iduth</b> is the term for the moon, so maybe something like <b>iduth-lila </b>or <b>iduth-zaanyah</b>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-08T11:09:53-08:00","id":826074,"title":"","content":"I was hoping you could help me with translating a name for an Idigam idea I had. I'm calling it <b>The Hero of Man</b>, a silver-clad Earthbound who seeks to create &quot;A world without monsters&quot;... which, of course, would involve cleansing the earth of every last drop of Father Wolf's blood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T14:20:26-08:00","id":829870,"title":"","content":"God-Machine allmighty! The word &quot;Imressive&quot; does not even come close to beggining to describe what you're doing here! I don't know how many storytellers in this world are grateful to you to no ends, but you can count me in...<br /> Also, if it wouldn't be too much of a problem, I'd like to make a request some Changeling and Demon terms, for crossover utility, the most important ones, that is(For Changeling: <b>Arcadia</b>, <b>Contract</b>, <b>Court</b>, <b>The Gentry</b>, <b>Glamour</b>, <b>Goblins</b>, <b>Hedge</b>, <b>Seeming</b>, <b>Wyrd</b>, and, of course, <b>Changelings </b>themselves. For Demon: <b>Angel</b>, <b>Aether</b>, <b>Cover</b>, <b>Embed</b>, <b>Exploit</b>, <b>Fractal</b>, <b>God-Machine</b>, <b>Incarnation</b>, <b>Infrastructure</b>, <b>Offspring</b>, <b>Primum</b>, and of course, <b>Demon </b>in the D:tD meaning of the term.) I know it's a lot and you're a busy person, so, fell free to do them whenever you want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-18T16:16:47-08:00","id":832812,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Inquisitor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=829870#post829870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">God-Machine allmighty! The word &quot;Imressive&quot; does not even come close to beggining to describe what you're doing here! I don't know how many storytellers in this world are grateful to you to no ends, but you can count me in...<br /> Also, if it wouldn't be too much of a problem, I'd like to make a request some Changeling and Demon terms, for crossover utility, the most important ones, that is(For Changeling: <b>Arcadia</b>, <b>Contract</b>, <b>Court</b>, <b>The Gentry</b>, <b>Glamour</b>, <b>Goblins</b>, <b>Hedge</b>, <b>Seeming</b>, <b>Wyrd</b>, and, of course, <b>Changelings </b>themselves. For Demon: <b>Angel</b>, <b>Aether</b>, <b>Cover</b>, <b>Embed</b>, <b>Exploit</b>, <b>Fractal</b>, <b>God-Machine</b>, <b>Incarnation</b>, <b>Infrastructure</b>, <b>Offspring</b>, <b>Primum</b>, and of course, <b>Demon </b>in the D:tD meaning of the term.) I know it's a lot and you're a busy person, so, fell free to do them whenever you want.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm... lots of proper nouns and technical terms...<br /> <br /> Some of these have already been addressed:<br /> <br /> <b>Ninurum</b> is the term used for the realm of the True Fae, literally meaning &quot;an area surrounded by hedges&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Kathir</b> is the Hedge, literally the &quot;Great Thorn Bush Forest&quot;<br /> <br /> <b>Angii-Thilikh</b> is the God-Machine<br /> <br /> <b>Angzermusim</b> refers to the angels of the God-Machine<br /> <br /> <b>besdurzi</b> seems like an appropriate enough equivalent for &quot;offspring,&quot; as used in Demon; it can literally mean offspring or descendants, but can also refer to an offshoot of some &quot;parent&quot; phenomenon.<br /> <br /> Sikla will probably want to take a crack at the rest himself, but I can't resist coming up with my own interpretations:<br /> <br /> First of all, based on the morphology we've seen so far and the derivation of the names for other groups related to the God Machine, <b>Angzer</b> seems to be a term (or at least an element in compounds) meaning &quot;of or related to the God-Machine.&quot; Based on that, I would propose the following:<br /> <br /> <b>Angzerhufar:</b> A Demon, as in a fallen angel of the God-Machine (roughly &quot;adversary of the God-Machine&quot;)<br /> <br /> <b>Angii-er:</b> Aether (something like &quot;God's tears&quot;)<br /> <br /> <b>Angzera'ur: </b>Infrastructure (&quot;limb of the God-Machine&quot;)<br /> <br /> <b>Lul-Ikhi:</b> Cover (literally &quot;false face&quot;)<br /> <br /> Not sure what to do with the other Demon ones at the moment, but here are a few ideas for the Changeling ones:<br /> <br /> <b>Falahazi:</b> Changeling (literally &quot;changed soul&quot;)<br /> <br /> <b>At-Nuun:</b> One of the True Fae (roughly &quot;brier-prince&quot;)<br /> <br /> <b>Dirum: </b>Court<br /> <br /> <b>Seh</b><b>:</b> Contract (I found one reference to this word meaning &quot;agreement.&quot; Sumerian uses the word for &quot;agreement&quot; to refer to contracts, so I figure First Tongue should too)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-20T20:31:40-08:00","id":834225,"title":"","content":"What would an appropriate translation for a robotic/metallic body that a wolf-blood rides in in order to make up for the fact that he isn't a full werewolf and thus needs the use it to make up for his weaknesses?<br /> <br /> Long story short, I am making a WolfBlood specific robotic Mech fetish to emulate the Killing Form. Why? Rule of cool mostly. And you never know who'd need such a thing for their games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/607039-homebrew-mechs-walkers-ect\" target=\"_blank\">Mechs:</a> Because even the Chronicles of Darkness needs robot fights.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/813387-darkframe-a-far-future-crossover-setting\" target=\"_blank\">DarkFrame</a>: Crossover setting that puts Chronicles of Darkness in the far future that is Warframe.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\" target=\"_blank\">Monarch: The Endless</a> You are an alien ruler, charged with maintaining a people who you shape to suit your needs.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7015-almarck","name":"Almarck","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1156"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-23T15:22:14-08:00","id":836056,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solidork</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=781210#post781210\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about a word for someone or something from your life before your first change. There can be a TON of different connotations for how someone feels about said person/thing (from desperate longing to complete disdain) but I don't know if there should be separate words for those cases.</div> </div> </div> </div>I could still use this translation, if it isn't too much of a problem for anyone.<br /> <br /> Also, does Anshega have a literal translation?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9001-solidork","name":"solidork","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-21T11:49:39-07:00","id":850721,"title":"","content":"I would love some help translating &quot;The Wolf-Born&quot; or literally &quot;Born From Wolves&quot; for a campaign I'm working on, centering around a character literally born from a normal female wolf. Much appreciated!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4906-deraneo","name":"Deraneo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T21:35:54-07:00","id":854870,"title":"","content":"How would one convey the concept of 'Motorcycle' in first tongue? It has to do with a character I'm working on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-29T17:22:02-07:00","id":855365,"title":"","content":"I imagine it'd be some variation of 'Two-Legged Steel Steed' if it were translated literally.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T02:09:11-07:00","id":855587,"title":"","content":"I'm waffling a bit on how I want to name my updated Mokol\u00e9. I have previously gone with &quot;Makilu&quot; (fitting because it sounds similar, even), but I also like &quot;Saurilu.&quot; Which basically comes from taking &quot;saruru,&quot; which means to be great, brilliant, shining, burning hot (<i>perfect </i>for sun-based dragon-monster werebeasts), chopping off the end, and reversing two letters. It's also Akkadian, but I don't mind cheating a bit. It's all the same. &quot;ilu&quot; means god. But &quot;eru&quot; also means &quot;bird&quot; of various types, and Eru is the god of Middle-earth, so it just sounds good. Also, somewhere I saw &quot;eden&quot; as having to do with birds, and putting &quot;eden&quot; in a dinosaur name would be too awesome. But I'm thinking Saurilu. What do y'all think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-30T05:09:45-07:00","id":855625,"title":"","content":"I like Saurilu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T01:39:34-07:00","id":867438,"title":"","content":"Could I ask for a First Tongue translation to &quot;Eater of Names&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T02:21:29-07:00","id":867446,"title":"","content":"Something like... Humuz-Ur.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T03:56:14-07:00","id":867473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=867446#post867446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something like... Humuz-Ur.</div> </div> </div> </div>And Humuz means?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T04:10:19-07:00","id":867476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deionscribe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=867473#post867473\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And Humuz means?</div> </div> </div> </div>Verb to eat and noun of name.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T03:20:46-07:00","id":868299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/813506-sell-an-apocalypse-fan-on-forsaken-or-w-tf-wtf?p=815254#post815254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't want to have to learn a fourth language just to play a role playing game. A few terms for flavor and mood setting is fine, but....</div> </div> </div> </div>I would *love* to learn a fourth language, and the First Tongue looks awesome. I do have some questions though:<br /> <br /> 1. What does De-Grimmified mean?<br /> 2. Is there a guide to pronunciation for the letter/phonemes of the First Tongue? Especially the vowels? I also seem to remember a mention somewhere that it is difficult for people in human form to pronounce the First Tongue, that were-forms could pronounce it more easily. Is this reflected in its pronunciation or construction?<br /> 3. Is there a specified word order, or other basic grammatical structure? i.e., is there a guide to stringing words together into a sentence? What about for compound words?<br /> 4. In your dictionary, is there a distinction between &quot;canon&quot; terms mentioned in sourcebooks and terms that have been invented by others?<br /> 5. Is the Latin alphabet we use for English the main one used in writing the First Tongue? Any extra letters? Any unused letters? Any written form with an alternate alphabet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11630,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11630-guang","user":"guang","date":". 04-19-2016, 08:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11630-guang","name":"guang","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T05:36:30-07:00","id":868341,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>guang</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=868299#post868299\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1. What does De-Grimmified mean?</div> </div> </div> </div>Most First Tongue is made by taking Ancient Sumerian and running them backwards through the sound-shifting trend known as <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grimm%27s_law\" target=\"_blank\">Grimm's Law</a> to get something suitably ancient-sounding.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T06:28:29-07:00","id":868368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=868341#post868341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Most First Tongue is made by taking Ancient Sumerian and running them backwards through the sound-shifting trend known as <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grimm%27s_law\" target=\"_blank\">Grimm's Law</a> to get something suitably ancient-sounding.</div> </div> </div> </div> There's also another stage in creating First Tongue words.; it's not *just* de-Grimming Sumerian.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T14:49:19-07:00","id":868788,"title":"","content":"Yeah, there's a lot of 'whatever the writer thinks sounds cool' as well. And some writers take the Akkadian word instead of the Sumerian. And some run Grimm's Law forwards instead of backwards. It really comes down to the rule of cool.<br /> <br /> On the third tab of my Sumerian Degrimmified spreadsheet if a list of observations about how writers have coincidentally tended to create First Tongue words too. One day I'll script those up for fun and make a new column of &quot;Possible First Tongue&quot; words since not all writers have the time or inclination to delve into the linguistic changes required, when they could just look up a meaning and take a word with minimal adjustments to taste required.<br /> <br /> But that's a ways off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T22:13:36-07:00","id":873539,"title":"","content":"Been thinking of making a 2E Conversion of the Melusinae from the Changing Breeds supplement. Can anyone give me a First Tongue translation for their nickname, &quot;Singing Serpents&quot;?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-27T04:07:39-07:00","id":875476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=868341#post868341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Most First Tongue is made by taking Ancient Sumerian and running them backwards through the sound-shifting trend known as <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grimm%27s_law\" target=\"_blank\">Grimm's Law</a> to get something suitably ancient-sounding.</div> </div> </div> </div>Love it. Complex enough to be interesting, enough basis in a real language to be realistic, and from a language isolate too! But is it usable? So far, in the WtF products I've had the chance to look at so far, words in the First Tongue are dropped into all-English conversations. Is it possible to converse in First Tongue?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11630-guang","name":"guang","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-27T05:19:45-07:00","id":875514,"title":"","content":"Technically, yes. In this very thread there are translatiosn of some long sentences as well as terminology and spare words.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-06T08:31:36-07:00","id":883805,"title":"","content":"I do have a number of do that need translating if Sikla or someone else who is a linguistic guru if they are okay with it <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Bone Breaker ( as in one who breaks bones)<br /> Fodder ( as in.. well fodder. expendable)<br /> Hidden Queen<br /> bearer of one's life spark.<br /> Forager ( one who forages)<br /> Worker ( this may have been translated before, but sadly I am unaware of it.)<br /> He who Feeds on War","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 05-06-2016, 12:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T16:30:13-07:00","id":897324,"title":"","content":"I consider CatDoom another valid translator for the First Tongue Project, so anything he comes up with before me has my backing. If he posts a translation, use that. I also like Humuz-Ur.<br /> <br /> I'll see if I can put up some translations soon, unless someone else gets to them first. If they do, then use those translations. I'll also see if I can finish off some of my word lists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":1874,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","user":"Sikla Alkis","date":". 05-23-2016, 07:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-23T21:27:36-07:00","id":897554,"title":"","content":"So can I have the translation for &quot;sheepdog&quot;?<br /> <br /> That's in the context of a dog that herds sheep, not a sheep that's also a dog.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4968-mrbreaksit","name":"MrBreaksIt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T07:05:09-07:00","id":897770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrBreaksIt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=897554#post897554\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So can I have the translation for &quot;sheepdog&quot;?<br /> <br /> That's in the context of a dog that herds sheep, not a sheep that's also a dog.</div> </div> </div> </div>Off the top of my head. <b>su'biurhir</b>. Literally means &quot;dog who inherently herds&quot;. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T07:06:54-07:00","id":897773,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>guang</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=875476#post875476\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Love it. Complex enough to be interesting, enough basis in a real language to be realistic, and from a language isolate too! But is it usable? So far, in the WtF products I've had the chance to look at so far, words in the First Tongue are dropped into all-English conversations. Is it possible to converse in First Tongue?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is the end goal here. We have a pronunciation guide somewhere, and the grammar has a very rough sketch to it, but I still need to study the basics of Sumerian grammar before we have anything usable. The devs use a grammar, IIRC, that is closer to Sumerian than what I have used, so I have to alter my work to fit that better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T16:39:00-07:00","id":898365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=897770#post897770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Off the top of my head. <b>su'biurhir</b>. Literally means &quot;dog who inherently herds&quot;. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks muchly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4968-mrbreaksit","name":"MrBreaksIt","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-24T22:57:46-07:00","id":898676,"title":"","content":"the Sumerian - DeGrimmifier spreadsheet has a small pronunciation guide. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, I must work on that again soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-28T19:30:18-07:00","id":902446,"title":"","content":"Got some easy ones for you: did they ever do ones for pack, tribe and territory?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage the Awakening 2e Communal Homebrew Threads:<br /> - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/966394-perils-of-the-path-post-your-homebrew\" target=\"_blank\">Perils of the Path</a> - Other homebrew threads linked in the OP!<br /> <br /> Join us at the unofficial IRC channels on.irc.sorcery.net at #exalted and now #theonyxpath!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/451-kirby-jerusalem","name":"Kirby Jerusalem","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar451_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"589"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-01T12:29:49-07:00","id":905100,"title":"","content":"Hi, it's a me again! Either way, I have another request for translations, if any of you'd be so kind.<br /> First one is a spirit of the Vigil, who goes by &quot;Keeper of Candles&quot;<br /> Second is an Idigam who took a shine on crime drama tropes and adopted the name &quot;Stolen Screentime&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor","name":"Inquisitor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T07:32:10-07:00","id":907623,"title":"","content":"Any chance I could get a first tongue translation of &quot;<span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\">He Who Runs Through the Halls of the Dead and Bathes in the Blood of the Unworthy&quot;?<br /> <br /> It's a Predator King Deed Name and I figure if they eschew human creations it might extend to their names/former names.<br /> <br /> Also hoping the First Tongue translation gives me an easy route to shortening/nicknames other characters can use, haha. Because as it stands it's a mouthful</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","user":"Amravanti","date":". 06-05-2016, 02:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti","name":"Amravanti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"465"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-05T16:29:17-07:00","id":907962,"title":"","content":"Can I get a first tongue word or phrase for an item (Hi Tech Gadget, Fad Toy, that sort of thing) that people riot over during things like Black Friday, thus giving birth to a hoard of spirits of violence, greed and consumerism, along with the tech and joy spirits associated with the product itself.<br /> <br /> I also want a name for a spirit of parental moral panics, covering things like the anti-comic book stuff caused by seduction of the innocent, the backwards masking thing with heavy metal and yes, even the anti RPG and video game panics all the way to more out there internet spread parental freakouts like iDosing and rainbow parties.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-22T21:45:12-07:00","id":935932,"title":"","content":"Hello. I'd like to request a First Tongue name for <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/921821-2e-lodges-conversions-and-homebrew?p=935506#post935506\">this Lodge totem of mine</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe","name":"Deionscribe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","