]},{"date":"2016-08-18T07:50:11-07:00","id":953170,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8180-deionscribe\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8180\" data-vbnamecard=\"8180\">Deionscribe</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11117-inquisitor\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11117_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11117\" data-vbnamecard=\"11117\">Inquisitor</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5279-amravanti\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar5279_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5279\" data-vbnamecard=\"5279\">Amravanti</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3932_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3932\" data-vbnamecard=\"3932\">The young man in the cafe</a> :<br /> <br /> liz: crumbs, scraps, pieces<br /> Urliz/Ur-Liz/Ur Liz: Scrap Hounds<br /> a'iltudu-besdul: praying mantis/a mantis (lit. &quot;praying ones who raise their arms to strike&quot;)<br /> Namubesdulu: Mantis Hosts (lit. &quot;death prayer hosts&quot;)<br /> Iziduksium-Igi: Eye of Providence (lit. &quot;Flaming Shield Eye&quot;)<br /> suguludaha: a fad or toy that people get worked up over, with the potential to cause chaos if it's low in stock, such as a hot toy during Christmastime on a Black Friday; something that is popular and desirable, but ultimately might be bad or not worth it in a long run (lit. &quot;treasure treat&quot;)<br /> <br /> skush: to cover with liquid; to envelop; to douse; to pour over; to coat<br /> kunnu: to be unworthy, weak, worthless; to not be strong; to be of omega-ish qualities in a pack<br /> Kunnumuth-Skushdu-Gimak-Zardu-Munu: He Who Runs Through the Halls of the Dead and Bathes In the Blood of the Unworthy (lit. &quot;unworthy blood-bathing tomb [halls of the dead] running [male] one&quot;) \u2014 short forms could include Zardul (&quot;runner&quot;), Muth-Skushdul (&quot;blood-bather&quot;), and Gimak-Ina-Zardul (&quot;one who runs through the tomb [halls of the dead]&quot;)<br /> <br /> izidukul: a torch<br /> izifuful: a candle (lit. &quot;fire twig&quot;)<br /> Izifufulag-Nazaru: Candle Keeper (lit. &quot;guardian of the candles&quot;)<br /> zidu-cahha: a movie, a motion picture (lit. &quot;living story&quot;)<br /> zidu-cahhabh: a movie screen, a television screen, or any other screen that's showing media of any kind (lit. &quot;living story window&quot;)<br /> Izul-Cahha-Anna-Zidu-Cahhabh: Stolen Screentime (lit. &quot;Steals the Story From the Screen&quot;)<br /> <br /> Hirfathra-Dunfathul: Bone-Breaker<br /> ezthum: cannon fodder, expendable forces<br /> u'il: carrier, runner; one who bears or carries something<br /> zila'u-u'il: &quot;bearer of one's life spark&quot;<br /> thegh: to forage; to pick out; to collect; to search through<br /> theghul: a forager; one who forages<br /> unil: a worker, a laborer<br /> Hafal Agalu/Hafal-Agalu/Hafagalu: He Who Feeds On War (lit. &quot;war-eater&quot;)<br /> <br /> @Kirby Jerusalem: They have been done! You can find them here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1TSgzm7rkkXyobz7wHfIGhGHT34zItHorGJnxsIvsisU/edit?pref=2&amp;pli=1#gid=1890564968\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets...gid=1890564968</a><br /> <br /> @ Everybody else: I've sometimes disappeared for a while before and come back with translations. I'm not gone yet! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T20:36:41-07:00","id":953628,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the translation <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, I was wondering if you could give me a First Tongue name for <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/930317-the-eaters-of-names-2e-homebrew\">these guys</a>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/806810-deionscribe-s-homebrew-hub#post806810\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;My Homebrew Hub&quot;</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/828132-open-invite-age-of-azar\" target=\"_blank\">Age of Azar</a><br /> \u2022 <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/907224-the-kingdom-of-yamatai-dark-era\" target=\"_blank\">The Kingdom of Yamatai</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com